translate chinese ch2ep2_bcfd1f6e:

    # f "And?"
    f "然后呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:42
translate chinese ch2ep2_f0b13e48:

    # e "And we found nothing."
    e "没有任何收获。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:43
translate chinese ch2ep2_0a2fbde6:

    # f "Ain't that the usual, though?"
    f "不是每次都是这样吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:44
translate chinese ch2ep2_12262acd:

    # e "Trucks were there, alright. But by the time we showed up? Nothing. Only tire marks and some fuel stains."
    e "的确有卡车去过那里。不过我们找到那的时候，什么都不剩了。只有轮胎印和一些燃油的痕迹。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:45
translate chinese ch2ep2_743fdf57:

    # f "So they cleared out?"
    f "所以是他们把那里清理干净了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:46
translate chinese ch2ep2_3b143a4a:

    # e "Couldn't tell you. Either way, that's a few hours of my life I'm not getting back."
    e "我不能透露案情。总而言之，我又浪费了几个小时的生命。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:49
translate chinese ch2ep2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:50
translate chinese ch2ep2_ed2bc60c:

    # f "That's... uhh... rough."
    f "好吧……呃……还挺辛苦。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:51
translate chinese ch2ep2_30adffde:

    # e "... Wasn't even a solid lead. Went to check it out anyway..."
    e "……那线索本来就不靠谱。但我还是想去确认一下……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:52
translate chinese ch2ep2_56ec083e:

    # f "You think someone tipped them off or something?"
    f "会不会是有人跟他们告密？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:53
translate chinese ch2ep2_a4a2130f:

    # e "I don't know. Or maybe [mc]'s right and we're just chasing ghosts at this point."
    e "不知道。也可能[mc!t]说得对，我们现在只是在疑神疑鬼。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:54
translate chinese ch2ep2_2df41999:

    # f "Hey, at least you went. Better than sitting around wondering what if, right?"
    f "至少你去看了嘛。总比坐在家里后悔要好，对吧？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:55
translate chinese ch2ep2_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:58
translate chinese ch2ep2_6c791dd5:

    # e "Yeah... I guess..."
    e "是啊……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:59
translate chinese ch2ep2_28ee5f87:

    # f "Well? What do I even say? I don't know jack about detective stuff..."
    f "好吧，我也不知道该说什么了。我根本不懂什么查案追凶啊……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:60
translate chinese ch2ep2_de2529a5:

    # f "But just... don't brood all night, okay? You reek of diesel and disappointment right now."
    f "但你……可别一晚上都闷闷不乐的，好吗？你现在身上全是柴油和郁闷的味道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:61
translate chinese ch2ep2_984cc484:

    # e "I—"
    e "我——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:71
translate chinese ch2ep2_987e3d37:

    # e "Really?"
    e "真的吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:72
translate chinese ch2ep2_b040a9e9:

