    # m "I don't know how long I can keep this up, Gwen."
    m "我不知道我能隐瞒多久，格温。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:285
translate chinese ch2ep2_c3ee2073:

    # m "This isn't... I don't know what I'm supposed to do..."
    m "这实在……我不知道我该怎么办才好……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:286
translate chinese ch2ep2_e63e4caa:

    # g "Maybe you should tell him to stop using it?"
    g "要不你跟他说，别再吃那个了？"

