    # m "No, I told you, it doesn't matter because that's not the problem."
    m "不行，我跟你说了，那样也没用，因为那根本不是问题所在。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:290
translate chinese ch2ep2_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:291
translate chinese ch2ep2_d874dfe4:

    # g "I'm sorry I couldn't find anyone. I just burned nine months away from him. I should've stayed."
    g "对不起，我没找到人帮忙。我白白在外面浪费了九个月。我应该留在他身边的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:292
translate chinese ch2ep2_8ab0fb0d:

    # m "It wasn't a waste. You tried."
    m "没有浪费。你尽力了。"

