    # g "You think he knows?"
    g "你说他会不会已经知道了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:300
translate chinese ch2ep2_b3bcefd2:

    # m "I think he knows something. But not how far it goes."
    m "他应该有所察觉。但还不知道具体到什么程度。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:308
translate chinese ch2ep2_da3624f1:

    # m "We should just tell him, Gwen."
    m "我们应该直接告诉他，格温。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:309
translate chinese ch2ep2_5e3458e3:

    # g "And watch him turn it into a schedule?"
    g "然后让他又要多操心一件事？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:310
translate chinese ch2ep2_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:311
translate chinese ch2ep2_9e7ac8a5:

    # g "He'd start planning around it. Us. Work. The future. Like it's... another fucking deadline."
    g "他会开始做各种计划。我们的事。工作的事。未来的事。就好像……又多了一个该死的截止日期一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:312
translate chinese ch2ep2_2714fa95:

    # g "You know him. He won't stop there."
    g "你了解他。他不会轻易罢休。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:313
translate chinese ch2ep2_c75c7fe2:

    # m "And if we don't tell him, he'll keep pretending there's time."
    m "可如果我们不告诉他，他就会假装还有时间。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:314
translate chinese ch2ep2_3a819b9d:

    # g "Is there?"
    g "真的还有时间吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:315
translate chinese ch2ep2_64d91354:

    # m "I don't know."
    m "我不知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:319
translate chinese ch2ep2_63ead738:

    # m "*exhales* What are you going to do?"
    m "*叹气* 你打算怎么办？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:320
translate chinese ch2ep2_1eb98b01:

    # g "Be with him."
    g "陪着他。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:321
translate chinese ch2ep2_f9b430e0:

    # g "... So should you."
    g "……你也应该陪着他。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:327
translate chinese ch2ep2_fa64143f:

    # g "Hey, Moon."
    g "月。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:328
translate chinese ch2ep2_a810d3f5:

    # m "Yeah?"
    m "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:329
translate chinese ch2ep2_e930dd1c:

    # g "If this gets worse—"
    g "如果情况恶化——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:330
translate chinese ch2ep2_9e4f3503:

    # m "—I'll be there."
    m "——我会在他身边的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:344
translate chinese ch2ep2_2f39a4cc:

    # k "(Really? You actually went and got it?)"
    k "（你真的去买了啊？）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:345
translate chinese ch2ep2_449f8177:

    # jov "(Hey, don't give me a hard time. You know I've been wanting one.)"
    jov "（哎，别这样嘛。你知道我一直想要一个的。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:346
translate chinese ch2ep2_099eb49f:

    # k "(Ah, [mc]! Don't do that!)"
    k "（啊，[mc!t]！不行！）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:350
translate chinese ch2ep2_3f07b818:

    # jov "(It's been a while since I last touched this thing. Life's been... well, a bit of a whirlwind—work and everything else.)"
    jov "（我上次用这东西都是很久以前了。生活太忙碌了……又是工作，又是其他事的。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:351
translate chinese ch2ep2_acbcb774:

    # jov "(Oh, right! Klara finally gave birth to Sky.)"
    jov "（哦，对了！我和克拉拉的孩子也出生了，是个女孩，叫斯凯。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:352
translate chinese ch2ep2_8122ce1e:

    # jov "(She's been with us for a year now, and she's always trailing behind [mc]. Those two are practically inseparable. It's the sweetest thing.)"
    jov "（她现在都已经一岁了，天天跟着[mc!t]到处跑。他们到哪都不分开，实在太可爱了。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:353
translate chinese ch2ep2_303da139:

    # k "(Can you put the camera down for a bit? You've been staring at that thing all day!)"
    k "（你就不能把摄像机放下一会吗？你都玩了一天了！）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:354
translate chinese ch2ep2_8339d9e7:

    # k "(Sky needs you, and I need help in the kitchen, too!)"
    k "（斯凯需要你照顾，我在厨房里也需要人帮忙！）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:355
translate chinese ch2ep2_abdb51d2:

    # jov "(Okay, okay, just a sec!)"
    jov "（好吧，好吧，等一下！）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:359
translate chinese ch2ep2_77388468:

    # k "(Awww! Aren't they adorable?)"
    k "（哈哈哈！你看他们多可爱啊！）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:360
translate chinese ch2ep2_853ffa3c:

    # jov "(Here we are, [mc] trying to teach Sky to walk. He's barely got it down himself, but he's so eager to help her.)"
    jov "（看啊，[mc!t]想教斯凯走路呢。他自己都不怎么会，但还是急着教她。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:361
translate chinese ch2ep2_9eb3516b:

    # jov "(Their laughter, their games are full of love.)"
    jov "（他们的笑声，他们的游戏——都充满了爱意。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:362
translate chinese ch2ep2_326ca524:

    # jov "(Watching [mc] help Sky, and her looking up to him like he's a superhero—it's perfect.)"
    jov "（看着[mc!t]帮斯凯，还有她像看超级英雄一样看着他——太完美了。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:363
translate chinese ch2ep2_5e99caa4:

    # jov "(Capturing these moments feels like I'm keeping something precious forever.)"
    jov "（这些时刻都是我最珍贵的东西，我要永远保存。）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:364
translate chinese ch2ep2_d4e87821:

    # jov "(I just hope we can keep these good times going...)"
    jov "（我只希望这样的好日子可以一直持续下去……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:368
translate chinese ch2ep2_f0f35c78:

    # jov "(This entry's hard... [mc]'s been feeling sick... a lot...)"
    jov "（今天的视频有点难受……[mc!t]最近病得很重……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:369
translate chinese ch2ep2_e962f582:

    # jov "(The coughing doesn't stop, and it's not just a regular cold...)"
    jov "（咳嗽怎么也停不下来，而且也不是普通的感冒……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:370
translate chinese ch2ep2_0a414586:

    # jov "(He's also been clumsy, tripping over nothing, which isn't like him...)"
    jov "（他还变得笨手笨脚的，莫名其妙就会摔倒，非常不正常……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:371
translate chinese ch2ep2_44df5cd0:

    # jov "(And he looks pale, even though we've been outside a lot. It's got to be something more...)"
    jov "（而且他肤色也很白，尽管我们经常带他出去玩。肯定是出什么事了……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:372
translate chinese ch2ep2_2748cd46:

    # jov "(You can tell, he's not his usual self...)"
    jov "（一下子就能看出来，他非常不正常……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:373
translate chinese ch2ep2_f7431e9d:

    # jov "(It's hard seeing him try to keep up with Sky but get tired so quickly...)"
    jov "（看到他努力想跟上斯凯，却很快就累了，我心里非常难受……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:374
translate chinese ch2ep2_2530d38b:

    # jov "(He's frustrated because he can't keep going like she does...)"
    jov "（他没法跟她一样，肯定心里很不高兴……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:375
translate chinese ch2ep2_a30fe3cf:

    # jov "(The nights are tougher. His coughing keeps us all up...)"
    jov "（到了夜里就更不好受。他一直咳嗽，让我们每个人都睡不着……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:376
translate chinese ch2ep2_32c01dde:

    # jov "(I stay with him, holding his hand, until he falls asleep...)"
    jov "（我陪着他，握着他的手，一直到他睡着……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:377
translate chinese ch2ep2_424886b2:

    # jov "(Even in his sleep, he's restless...)"
    jov "（哪怕睡着了，他也没法安心……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:378
translate chinese ch2ep2_058cb428:

    # jov "(I keep hoping it'll get better, but deep down, I'm worried...)"
    jov "（我一直希望能有好转，但心底却只有担心……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:379
translate chinese ch2ep2_c0a0eb5f:

    # jov "(We've got doctor appointments lined up. I'm trying to be strong for Klara and Sky, but I'm scared. What if...)"
    jov "（我们已经预约了医生。我一直为了克拉拉和斯凯在保持坚强，但我其实很害怕。万一……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:380
translate chinese ch2ep2_36ca8731:

    # jov "(*sighs* I need to stop here...)"
    jov "（*叹气* 就拍到这里吧……）"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:542
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4196d412:

    # mc "Wait. Em."
    mc "等一下，小艾。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:545
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_deec92f8:

    # mc "Here. This is for you."
    mc "这个给你。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:548
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ea40fb5c:

    # e "What—"
    e "什么——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:549
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5c673153:

    # e "When?"
    e "你什么时候拿到的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:552
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_12493e98:

    # mc "Back when we raided Hera's place. She told me it was on me to get it to you."
    mc "在我们去找赫拉的时候。她跟我说，把这封信给你是我的责任。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:553
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f70f8758:

    # mc "Look... I have no idea what it says, but I don't think it's my call to decide when you should read it."
    mc "我……不知道信里写了什么，但我觉得什么时候读它不该由我来决定。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:556
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_539003dc:

    # mc "I'm not gonna stop you if you've made up your mind, and I'm not banking on it changing anything."
    mc "如果你已经想好了，我不会阻止你，也不指望这封信会改变什么。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:557
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_301d026f:

    # mc "But I hope it helps you figure out where to go from here."
    mc "但我希望它能帮你弄清楚接下来该怎么走。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:558
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e4abe562:

    # mc "You're free, Em. Make it count."
    mc "你是自由的，小艾。不要蹉跎时光。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:565
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8bb4455f:

    # un "*catching her breath*"
    un "*大口喘气*"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:566
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_08a56052:

    # e "What's going on?"
    e "怎么回事？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:570
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b2ec8380:

    # un "Sec..."
    un "等一下……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:571
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a80b6b07:

    # un "Need to... catch my breath..."
    un "等我……喘口气……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:572
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dd063fff:

    # un "Stairs..."
    un "烦死……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:573
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f196940c:

    # un "Suck..."
    un "上楼梯了……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:574
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:577
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a0b0f9ab:

    # ela "Oh, hey! Elaine Harrison. Nice to meet you."
    ela "噢，你好！我是伊莱恩·哈里森。很高兴见到你。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:578
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_79380f70:

    # mc "We've met."
    mc "我们见过面。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:579
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_10d8c82d:

    # e "Damn it."
    e "服了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:582
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9163fcca:

    # e "Elaine!"
    e "伊莱恩！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:583
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_87be1c83:

    # ela "Yeah?"
    ela "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:584
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_50c39822:

    # e "Work!"
    e "说正事！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:590
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0869fd44:

    # ela "Right. Got something. Maybe."
    ela "哦对。有线索了。大概吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:594
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b13eec53:

    # ela "Here."
    ela "你看。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:595
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dd7ca4d3:

    # ela "Pulled this off a guy I picked up last week. Solicitation charge, but his call log's... interesting."
    ela "是从我上周盯上的一个男人手里查到的。他的罪名是拉皮条，不过他的通话记录……很有意思。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:598
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0caab2f8:

    # e "Club Ashen. Three calls in two days."
    e "“苍白”俱乐部。两天里打了三次电话。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:601
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d9e8c245:

    # ela "Yeah. And get this—"
    ela "是啊。还有这个——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:602
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a62b6e6b:

    # ela "My contact sent this over an hour ago. Says she saw two guys walking a kid through the side entrance last night."
    ela "一个小时之前我的线人发过来的。说是她在昨晚看见两个男人带着一个小孩从侧门进了俱乐部。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:605
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5800cbb7:

    # mc "She get a look at the kid?"
    mc "她看见那个小孩长什么样了吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:606
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_da590cdd:

    # ela "Yeah. Female. Red jacket. Maybe ten, eleven. Some weird muted copper-auburn hair."
    ela "看见了。是个女孩，穿红外套。大概十岁，十一岁的样子。头发颜色很奇怪，是那种暗暗的红棕色。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:607
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_044b8557:

    # mc "Kids dye their hair now?"
    mc "现在的小孩还会染头发？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:608
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2154a6d:

    # ela "Hence the \"weird.\" Pretty uncommon, if you ask me."
    ela "所以才说“奇怪”。要我说，这种颜色还挺少见的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:612
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_53e3515c:

    # e "Doesn't match anyone on our list."
    e "跟我们名单上的任何人都不匹配。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:613
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4165b39e:

    # mc "Which means she's unreported."
    mc "也就是说没人发现她失踪。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:614
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_473ab07d:

    # e "Or she hasn't been reported yet."
    e "或者暂时还没有报案。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:615
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b0175d48:

    # ela "Either way, a kid walking into a club at night? That alone is enough to check it out."
    ela "不管怎么说，光是有个小孩晚上走进俱乐部就足以让我们去调查一下了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:618
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_74b32d41:

    # e "Checking it out isn't the problem, Ela. What happens after we check it out is the problem."
    e "去调查不算什么问题，伊莱恩。问题是我们调查之后会发生什么。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:619
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ea37a647:

    # e "Say we go in. Say the kid's there. Say it's exactly what it looks like."
    e "假设我们过去之后，发现了那个小孩。假设情况就是我们想的那样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:620
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6deda7ae:

    # e "We'd still be walking into a club without a warrant, based on a tip from someone who was been drinking."
    e "但我们依然是仅凭着一个酒鬼提供的线索，就在没有搜查令的情况下闯进一家俱乐部。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:623
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a259009b:

    # ela "We're not raiding the place. We're responding to a potential child endangerment sighting."
    ela "我们又不是去突袭犯罪现场。只是去调查一下潜在的拐卖儿童事件。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:624
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_54eb8f8c:

    # e "And the second we pull out a gun or flash a badge, it becomes a raid."
    e "我们一旦拔枪或者亮出警徽，就跟突袭犯罪现场没什么区别了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:625
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cf978276:

    # e "Any halfway decent lawyer is going to pick apart how we got there. Who told us. What state they were in when they told us."
    e "任何一个稍微懂点法律的律师都会质疑我们是怎么知道这个线索的。是谁告诉我们的。告诉我们的时候，那人又是什么状态。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:626
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_81439e31:

    # ela "She wasn't wasted, Em. She'd had a few—"
    ela "她没喝醉，小艾。她只是摄入了些许——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:627
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3f5709b4:

    # e "A few is enough. You know that."
    e "些许就够了。你也清楚。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:630
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_be8aef6b:

    # mc "So the intel's real, but the source is the weak link."
    mc "所以情报是真的，但来源却不靠谱。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:631
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c1c6bbcf:

    # e "The source is always the weak link. That's how these things fall apart in court."
    e "来源永远都不靠谱。所以在法庭上才派不上用场。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:632
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_69a1c233:

    # e "We go in, we find something, we make arrests."
    e "我们出动，调查，抓人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:633
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4bcbee5f:

    # e "Six months later it gets thrown out because the tip came from a woman on her third drink at a bar."
    e "六个月之后，因为线索来自一个刚在酒吧里喝了三杯酒的女人，案件驳回。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:636
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f05efc98:

    # ela "So what, we just let it go?"
    ela "那怎么办，我们就不管了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:637
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d6edc6d5:

    # e "I didn't say that."
    e "我没这么说。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:638
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9ea1b00d:

    # e "I'm saying the freight depot cost me. Bad intel, rushed entry, nothing to show for it."
    e "我的意思是旧货运站的事已经让我吃了大亏了。情报不靠谱，行动也很匆忙，结果什么都没有。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:639
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dad38cd5:

    # e "The captain made it clear. One more mess and I'm done."
    e "警长的意思已经很清楚了。再搞砸一次，我就要卷铺盖走人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:640
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a83af33a:

    # ela "Wait. He actually said that?"
    ela "不会吧。他真那么说了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:644
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f91860ab:

    # e "He didn't have to spell it out. \"You're on thin ice, Meyer\" covers it."
    e "没有说那么直白。但那句“你现在已经是如履薄冰了，梅耶”就足以说明一切了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:642
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e45d5971:

    # ela "Shit... how bad was it?"
    ela "操……到底有多严重？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:643
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0c9287b0:

    # e "Bad enough that I'm having this conversation instead of already being in the car."
    e "严重到我要跟你说这么一大堆话，而不是坐进车里准备出发。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:649
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5549afb5:

    # mc "Em."
    mc "小艾。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:650
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "怎么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:651
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_10ca2205:

    # mc "This isn't the depot. The depot was dead. No movement, no bodies, nothing."
    mc "这次跟货运站不一样。那个货运站里一片死寂，没有任何动静，也没有尸体，什么都没有。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:652
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5098415e:

    # mc "This has a kid walking through a door. That's not a maybe."
    mc "这次是一个小孩被带进了门。这绝对不是子虚乌有。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:653
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_aa0213b5:

