translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d6200dac:

    # mc "What'd you tell him?"
    mc "你怎么跟他说的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2362
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e9ce1039:

    # e "That they were moving her. That I had seconds, not a minute to spare."
    e "我说当时他们准备把她转移走了，时间非常紧迫。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2363
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e2ea64c8:

    # mc "You're not wrong. But you're still on the case?"
    mc "你说得没错。但这个案子应该还归你管吧？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2366
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_82dd9d7b:

    # e "He said the rescue bought me some rope. Then told me not to hang myself with it next time."
    e "他说营救成功给我加了不少分。然后又说让我不要得意忘形。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2367
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_262571ef:

    # e "Anyway. It's done. Moving on."
    e "总之，已经过去了。别再提了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2368
