    # mc "What about Francis?"
    mc "那弗朗西斯呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2369
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dedaa4b0:

    # mc "Leah just put him in a room with her."
    mc "他跟莉娅曾经待在一起过。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2370
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d93c4db0:

    # e "I'll write it up. File it. Drop it on the captain's desk with everything else we've got and let him call the next play."
    e "我会写成报告，整理好，跟其他情报一起丢到警长的桌子上。让他决定下一步吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2371
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_87a5b460:

    # mc "You're going by the book on this one."
    mc "你这次很守规矩啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2372
