    e "她说得对。就是这个问题。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2417
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b049e31e:

    # e "Sicae or not, you were on site when we pulled her out. That's a red flag the size of a billboard."
    e "不管你是不是西卡的人，把她救出来都有你的一份。这是天大的红线。"

