    # e "Timeline?"
    e "还有多少时间？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2476
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e3d92776:

    # ju "Weeks. Sometimes months. Depends on availability and how her psych eval shakes out."
    ju "好几个星期。也可能几个月。取决于愿意合作的家庭数量还有她的心理测试结果。"

