translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_64f728fa:

    # ju "If there's no match, she goes into a group facility until one opens up."
    ju "如果找不到匹配的，她就要被送进福利院，直到有合适的家庭出现。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2478
