translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5b617737:

    # ju "Look. I need you both to hear this clearly."
    ju "听我说。你们两个都认真听。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2486
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b3de0338:

    # ju "Getting her out was the hard part. Keeping her safe is the long game. And that doesn't always look the way you think it should."
    ju "把她救出来是最难的部分。但保她平安是一场持久战。而且这个过程可能会跟你们的想象有偏差。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:2489
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_62332188:

    # ju "It means process. Patience. Trusting the people handling it."
    ju "要按部就班。耐心等待。信任处理这些事的人。"

