translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f20577e6:

    # nad "I tried the number he gave me. Disconnected after the first week. I went to the address but it was empty. I didn't know what to do."
    nad "我试着给那个男人留的号码打过电话。一个星期之后就打不通了。我还去了他留的地址，但地址是假的。我不知道该怎么办了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3166
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c1841212:

    # ela "You could've gone to the police."
    ela "你可以报警啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3167
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_19fd5322:

    # nad "I know."
    nad "我知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3169
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fb66cb6e:

    # ela "Anything else about the man who approached you?"
    ela "关于那个男人，还有什么别的细节吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3170
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_eaca42ed:

    # nad "He was quiet. Soft-spoken. He didn't look like what he was."
    nad "他话很少。说话声音也很轻。他看起来不像是坏人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3171
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d85ea084:

    # ela "They almost never do."
    ela "哪有坏人看着像坏人的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3173
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fd4778e5:

    # nad "Is she okay?"
    nad "她还好吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3176
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f4424bb8:

    # ela "She's safe."
    ela "她很安全。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3177
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7f360981:

    # nad "That's not what I asked, Officer."
    nad "我不是问这个，警官。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3178
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2adba506_2:

    # ela "..."
    ela "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3180
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e196d5fb:

    # nad "She used to get nightmares when she was little. I'd sing to her—same song every time. She'd calm down before I even got through the first verse."
    nad "她小时候经常做噩梦。我会唱歌哄她睡觉——每次都是同一首歌。第一段还没唱完，她就已经安静下来了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3181
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_13f53a15_1:

    # nad "..."
    nad "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3182
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d6ee86ca:

    # nad "Does she still get them?"
    nad "她还会做噩梦吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3185
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5959eb87:

    # ela "We'll leave it there for now. Someone will be in to go over next steps."
    ela "就聊到这里吧。之后的事情会有其他人来负责。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3186
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5e525c71:

    # nad "Okay."
    nad "好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3189
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c81cfcf9:

    # ela "You good?"
    ela "你还好吧？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3190
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_92f16cc0_1:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "嗯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3191
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2adba506_3:

    # ela "..."
    ela "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3192
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1e0c3d67:

    # ela "She asked if Leah was okay."
    ela "她问了莉娅还好吗。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3193
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9970216e:

    # e "I heard her."
    e "我听到了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3194
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_465f2307:

    # ela "What are you going to do with that?"
    ela "你打算怎么办？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3195
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2d209982:

    # e "... Nothing."
    e "……不怎么办。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3197
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c64b76de:

    # e "I'm going to see Leah."
    e "我去看看莉娅。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3199
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9ce9e735:

    # ela "Hey! Can I come?"
    ela "等等！我能一起吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3200
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4c224c7c:

    # e "No. Do your job."
    e "不行。好好工作。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3201
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_072cad4f:

    # ela "Damn it."
    ela "可恶。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3210
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3f3065e2_2:

    # le "Hi."
    le "嗨。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3211
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fc67d5f8:

    # e "What are you working on?"
    e "你在干什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3212
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d52693ad:

    # le "Nothing."
    le "没干什么。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3213
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_09166cd3:

    # le "You smell like coffee again. You should smell like something else sometimes."
    le "你身上又是咖啡的味道。你应该偶尔也弄点其他的味道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3214
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1fb7213d:

    # e "Like...?"
    e "比如……？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3215
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2968fddc:

    # le "I don't know. Flowers? Or like... a bakery. So when you walk in it smells like something good is about to happen."
    le "我不知道。比如鲜花？或者……面包店的味道。这样你走进来的时候，我就会觉得要发生什么好事了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3216
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b21ca18d:

    # e "That's a high standard. I could step outside and buy some bread."
    e "这标准可不低。我可以出去买点面包。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3217
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_01409291:

    # le "I'm full."
    le "我吃饱了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3220
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d9c3f71d:

    # le "Did you come straight here?"
    le "你直奔这里来的吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3221
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f1932a81:

    # e "Pretty much."
    e "算是吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3222
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_14bec751:

    # le "I thought it was your day off."
    le "我还以为你今天休息。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3223
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_04710674:

    # e "How do you know that?"
    e "你怎么知道的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3224
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c6ba0a95:

    # le "Aunt June mentioned it."
    le "琼阿姨说的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3225
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d5ec3860:

    # e "Oh... She's your aunt now?"
    e "噢……她都成你阿姨了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3226
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_96a4ca11:

    # le "No, but she could pass for my aunt if my aunt went through a phase in her teenage years."
    le "不算是，但如果我的阿姨在她十几岁的时候有过叛逆期的话，倒是和琼阿姨差不多。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3227
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_37:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3228
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_58114a9f:

    # le "She said you're not coming here today."
    le "她说你今天不会来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3229
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d8fe1482:

    # e "*sighs* Why does she have to say everything?"
    e "*叹气* 为什么她什么事都往外说啊？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3230
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_47e1e68d:

    # le "She said the same thing about herself, actually. Especially when she's around her best friends."
    le "她其实也这么说过她自己。尤其她和她最好的朋友在一起的时候，更控制不住。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3231
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4bef1395:

    # e "Really...?"
    e "真的……？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3232
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ca6cc20c:

    # le "*clicking her pen*"
    le "*不断按笔帽*"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3233
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_34bbdace:

    # le "So why did you come?"
    le "所以你为什么来了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3234
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_03ec1331:

    # e "I'm... just checking in."
    e "我……只是来看看。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3235
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_742ea575:

    # le "It's your day off though."
    le "可你今天休息啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3236
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a925d4eb_1:

    # e "Leah."
    e "莉娅。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3237
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8b750fe9:

    # le "I'm just saying. You could've done something fun."
    le "我只是随口说说。你完全可以去做点有趣的事啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3238
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_61253c26:

    # e "This is fine. I can't even remember the last time I did anything fun. Like... actually went outside."
    e "现在就挺好。我都不记得我上次做有趣的事是什么时候了。比如……出门逛逛之类的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3239
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f0eb4856:

    # le "So sitting in a hospital room is fine?"
    le "待在医院病房里就挺好？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3240
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a7f37196:

    # e "Sitting in {i}this{/i} hospital room."
    e "只有{i}这间{/i}病房挺好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3241
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_98741ac3_12:

    # le "..."
    le "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3243
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a0c793d2:

    # e "New additions."
    e "有新成员啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3245
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_75aeba9f:

    # le "Oh. That pretty nurse brought them. She left them on the table when she came to check my blood pressure. I think she felt bad about the needle."
    le "噢。是那个漂亮的护士姐姐带来的。她来给我量血压的时候把它们放在了桌子上。我觉得她可能是觉得扎针的时候我会害怕，所以想让我开心一下。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3246
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_aee8f1fb:

    # e "Did it hurt?"
    e "疼吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3247
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_121b34fd:

    # le "A little. But I didn't cry."
    le "有一点。但我没有哭。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3248
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_69860613:

    # e "You named them yet?"
    e "你给他们起名字了吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3249
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_18be54d3:

    # le "The green blob is Gerald. He looks like a Gerald. Very serious face. Very dependable."
    le "绿色的叫杰罗德。他看着就很像是叫杰罗德的样子。表情很严肃。很可靠。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3250
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3fbcfc7a:

    # e "You can tell all that from a stuffed toy?"
    e "你能从毛绒玩具身上看出这些来？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3251
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d242e19f:

    # le "I can tell a lot from faces, actually."
    le "其实，我能从表情里看出来很多东西。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3252
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5ada8755:

    # le "Like right now you look like you didn't finish your lunch."
    le "比如你现在看起来像是没有吃完午饭。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3253
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d621439e:

    # e "I finished most of it."
    e "我吃了绝大部分。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3254
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4b023eec:

    # le "How much is most?"
    le "绝大部分是多少？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3255
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3b64a69f:

    # e "More than... half?"
    e "大概……超过一半？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3256
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e13e61a9:

    # le "... More than half isn't most. That's half."
    le "……超过一半不叫绝大部分。只是一半。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3257
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_25d6ad4d:

    # e "It was a really big sandwich."
    e "那个三明治特别大。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3258
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b756f77f:

    # le "Then you should've eaten the whole thing."
    le "那你应该把它吃完。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3259
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_38:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3260
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bf277abe:

    # e "You're starting to sound like [mc]."
    e "你开始跟[mc!t]一样说话了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3261
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bd475ded:

    # le "Huh?"
    le "啊？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3262
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_19e882b7:

    # e "I eat often. Just not a lot. And... I usually skip breakfast."
    e "我有好好吃饭。只是吃得不多。而且……一般不吃早饭。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3263
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_41de1caf:

    # le "*shaking her head* Tsk, tsk, tsk..."
    le "*摇头* 唉唉，不乖哦……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3265
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4acc3c28:

    # e "What about the cat loaf?"
    e "那只面包猫叫什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3266
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9c31e01d:

    # le "Doesn't have one yet. He's not ready to tell me. Gerald knew right away."
    le "还没有名字。他还没准备好告诉我。杰罗德倒是立马就跟我说了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3267
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ffb0cd61:

    # e "... You really have an odd way of naming things."
    e "……你给东西起名字的方式真是奇怪。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3268
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5d30eda4:

    # le "Mh-hm. My friends used to say I'm a genius."
    le "嗯哼。我朋友以前总说我是天才。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3270
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_49f95de5:

    # le "What do you think? For the cat bread."
    le "你觉得这只面包猫该叫什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3271
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c871818b:

    # e "I'm not good at names."
    e "我不擅长起名字。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3272
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7d96c53c:

    # le "Try anyway."
    le "试一下。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3273
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_57dd817c:

    # e "I really named my first plant \"Mr. Plant.\""
    e "我给我养的第一株植物就取名叫“植物先生”。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3274
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c4ef6f6b:

    # le "Yeah, you told me yesterday after the nap. And that it died. I think the name had something to do with it."
    le "是啊，你昨天午睡之后跟我说过。还说它后来死掉了。我觉得就是跟名字有关系。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3275
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_908fa202:

    # e "Plants don't really know their names."
    e "植物又不知道它们叫什么。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3276
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9a02d368:

    # le "How would you know?"
    le "你怎么能这么确定？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3277
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c31c279d:

    # e "I don't... I guess."
    e "这……好吧，确实不太能确定。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3278
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6c578f19:

    # le "Exactly. So try."
    le "对吧。所以你试试。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3279
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_643e0a21:

    # e "What color is he?"
    e "他是什么颜色的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3280
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_44128cc9:

    # le "Brown. Obviously."
    le "棕色的啊。一眼就看出来了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3281
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a386d2ce:

    # e "Does he look like anyone?"
    e "他有长得像某个人吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3282
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_98741ac3_13:

    # le "..."
    le "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3283
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d20bd3d3:

    # le "He kind of looks like Dr. Park."
    le "有点像帕克医生。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3284
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_82930e66:

    # e "I'm telling."
    e "我可要告诉她了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3285
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_964033fe:

    # le "Wait, no!"
    le "等等，不要！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3286
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2eb5338:

    # e "Kidding. Then maybe something in her lane. Something soft."
    e "开玩笑的。那说不定可以起一个跟她挺像的名字。温柔的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3287
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_98741ac3_14:

    # le "..."
    le "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3288
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7b2c5947:

    # le "Hm..."
    le "嗯……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3290
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0e135c78:

    # le "I'll think about it."
    le "我想想。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3291
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_33bbd41d_1:

    # e "Take your time."
    e "慢慢想。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3292
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_87e7a0b5:

    # le "Like Dr. Park?"
    le "跟帕克医生一样慢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3293
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_74fcdad6:

    # e "*chuckles* Like Dr. Park."
    e "*轻笑* 帕克医生是挺慢的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3294
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a9f3acb9:

    # le "*giggles* She walks so slow. How come?"
    le "*笑* 她走路也太慢了。为什么呀？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3295
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ed56ec0c:

    # e "She had a leg injury when she was young."
    e "她年轻的时候腿受过伤。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3296
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_101b4a4e:

    # e "Ah..."
    e "啊……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3298
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_52bb57c9:

    # e "What is that, anyway?"
    e "那是什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3299
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5fa7df7a:

    # le "My diary."
    le "我的日记。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3300
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e7d28f7b:

    # le "I've had it for a while. Since before."
    le "我已经写了很久。非常久。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3301
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c39d21dd:

    # e "Before the hospital?"
    e "在来医院之前就开始了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3302
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_97c8e06b:

    # le "Before mom changed..."
    le "是在妈妈变了之前就开始了……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3303
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8c3c5bf4:

    # le "She gave it to me when I was little. She said if something was too big to say out loud, write it down first."
    le "这本日记是她在我小时候给我的。她说如果有什么事情大到没法好好说出来，就先写下来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3304
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dbea8225:

    # le "Words find their way out whether you want them to or not, so it's better to give them somewhere to go."
    le "不管你愿不愿意，文字都会找上门来，所以最好给它们找一个去处。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3305
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_39:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3306
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4f026939:

    # le "Did someone ever teach you that?"
    le "有人跟你说过这些吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3307
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0296095e:

    # e "... My mom. Not a diary, though. Just letters. She said more or less the same thing."
    e "……我妈妈说过差不多一样的话。但她没有让我写日记，而是写信。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3308
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dc5c927d:

    # le "Did it actually help?"
    le "有作用吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3309
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1f0940bc:

    # e "I... kept writing them long after I had anyone left to send them to. So I think it must have."
    e "我……即使在无人可寄的情况下，也坚持写了很久的信。所以我觉得肯定是有用的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3310
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1a6a57c6:

    # le "... Yeah. I think so too."
    le "……是啊，我也这么想。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3314
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c9138944:

    # e "That's actually a pretty good drawing, by the way."
    e "对了，你画得很棒。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3315
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5b532562:

    # le "Is it?"
    le "真的吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3316
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_92f16cc0_2:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "嗯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3317
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dc7939aa:

    # le "The one I gave you was rougher—I didn't have much time."
    le "我给你的那幅画比较粗糙——我当时没什么时间。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3318
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_692e38d9:

    # e "Wait—is that me?"
    e "等等——那是我吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3319
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d097c387:

    # le "The coffee gave it away."
    le "从咖啡就能看出来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3320
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ff8ca38e:

    # e "What's the star above the vending machine?"
    e "自动售货机上面怎么会有星星？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3321
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bf85d7c4:

    # le "It gave me grape juice when I hit the wrong button. I didn't even want grape juice, but it was still nice. Like a surprise."
    le "我随便按了几个按钮，它就给了我葡萄汁。我也没想喝葡萄汁，但还是觉得它很好。算是个惊喜。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3322
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a2925337:

    # e "Why does the vending machine get a star for that?"
    e "那为什么售货机会因此得到星星呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3323
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a22ac376:

    # le "Uhm... because."
    le "呃……因为所以，科学道理。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3324
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_63143176:

    # e "... Okay. Then what's mine?"
    e "……好吧。那我有几颗星？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3325
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2a0f189:

    # le "Four and a half."
    le "四颗半。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3326
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_64edc989:

    # e "Out of...?"
    e "满分是……？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3327
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_646b4972:

    # le "Out of five."
    le "满分是五颗。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3328
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2add3f1b:

    # e "What am I losing half a star for?"
    e "我因为什么被扣了半颗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3329
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f3127dab:

    # le "The sandwich."
    le "你没吃完三明治。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3330
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_40:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3331
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f41ae80c:

    # e "Fair."
    e "好吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3333
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_47433c35:

    # le "Four and a half was generous, by the way."
    le "给你四颗半都算我大度了哦。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3334
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_41:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3507
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e23ec269:

    # le "How long have I been in here?"
    le "我来这里多久了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3508
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f0ae11fe:

    # e "Just a few days."
    e "几天吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3509
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2e87e223:

    # le "It feels longer. I haven't been outside once."
    le "感觉已经很久了。我一次都没有出去过。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3510
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d7db573f:

    # le "Everything here smells the same. Sounds the same. Even the light is the same all day."
    le "这里的所有东西都是一个味道。声音也一样。就连每天的灯光也全都一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3511
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c9754082:

    # e "Leah, I can't really take you out of the building. That's not something I'm allowed to do."
    e "莉娅，我不能带你到医院外面去。那是不允许的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3513
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9d407c00:

    # e "You have a TV. Are you not watching anything?"
    e "这里有电视。你没看过电视吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3514
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fac6c2a3:

    # le "I don't like watching TV. And cartoons are boring."
    le "我不喜欢看电视。动画片很无聊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3515
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_acd5badd:

    # e "... We can walk around if you want."
    e "……你想的话，我们可以去四处逛逛。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3516
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fe037aaa:

    # le "Like... right now?"
    le "就……现在吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3517
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_58676135:

    # e "Mm-hm. Right now."
    e "嗯哼。就现在。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3518
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ae1990ec:

    # le "Where, though?"
    le "去哪逛呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3519
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_aebaedb1:

    # e "Downstairs. There's a lobby."
    e "楼下。楼下有个大厅。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3520
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_34ff6c43:

    # le "Is it big?"
    le "很大吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3521
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a0f71f48:

    # e "Not that big, but... bigger than this room, for sure."
    e "不算太大，但是……肯定比这个房间大。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3522
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_50ca7075:

    # le "Okay!"
    le "我要去！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3523
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b5e271e8:

    # e "Come on."
    e "那走吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3529
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d34b22f6:

    # le "Whoa..."
    le "哇……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3530
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3308a954:

    # e "It's just a lobby, Leah."
    e "只是个大厅而已，莉娅。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3531
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_42c0ea9f:

    # le "It has windows."
    le "这里有窗户。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3532
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8ecf8f64:

    # e "I mean... It's a must."
    e "窗户……肯定会有啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3533
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c690d5ef:

    # le "Big ones. With outside in them."
    le "还是很大的窗户。能看见外面。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3535
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_29a86aec:

    # e "Hey, hey. Slow down."
    e "哎哎，慢点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3537
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ef58875d:

    # le "There's a guy out there walking a really tiny dog. It's wearing a sweater."
    le "外面有个人在遛一条特别小的狗。还穿着毛衣。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3538
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4785cbf3:

    # e "The guy?"
    e "人穿的吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3539
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_921dfaab:

    # le "The dog."
    le "狗穿的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3540
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6d5155f4:

    # le "I think it looks angry about the sweater. I'd hate it."
    le "我觉得它不想穿毛衣。我也不想。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3541
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1bd6aa12:

    # e "You don't like sweaters?"
    e "你不喜欢毛衣？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3542
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ed4754a1:

    # le "They're okay. I guess depends on the color."
    le "还行吧。看是什么颜色的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3546
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ba45c578:

    # le "Is that the front desk?"
    le "那是前台吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3548
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c1a72012:

    # le "Like a hotel?"
    le "酒店里的那种？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3549
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bf65ad37:

    # e "... Sort of. Don't bother the—"
    e "……算是吧。别去打扰——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3550
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3f3065e2_3:

    # le "Hi."
    le "嗨。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3551
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_55c91c53:

    # nur2 "Oh! Hello, sweetheart. Are you lost?"
    nur2 "噢！你好，小朋友。你迷路了吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3552
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_71750eff:

    # le "No. I'm with her."
    le "没有。我是跟她一起的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3553
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2dfc2ecf:

    # nur2 "Oh, is that your mom?"
    nur2 "噢，是你妈妈吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3555
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_67b5a662:

    # le "She's..."
    le "她是……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3556
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_480b718a:

    # e "I'm her—"
    e "我是她的——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3557
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8a0bd071:

    # le "She's my Emma."
    le "她是我的艾玛。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3558
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_307750d3:

    # nur2 "..."
    nur2 "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3559
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0f286280:

    # nur2 "That's... sweet."
    nur2 "真……可爱。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3561
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9fbf6040:

    # e "Sorry. We're just walking around."
    e "抱歉。我们就是四处走走。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3562
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1f216c15:

    # nur2 "No worries. Enjoy the tour."
    nur2 "没关系。你们尽情走吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3563
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e5e24b30:

    # le "Do you like working here?"
    le "你喜欢在这里工作吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3564
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5135998f:

    # nur "Hm? Oh... Most days, yeah. Why do you ask?"
    nur "嗯？噢……大多数时候都挺喜欢的。你为什么问这个呀？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3565
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d0d146bc:

    # le "The chairs look comfortable."
    le "那把椅子感觉坐着很舒服。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3566
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_34bb105a:

    # nur "*laughs* They're alright. The ones in the rooms upstairs are worse."
    nur "*大笑* 感觉是不错。楼上房间里的就不怎么样了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3567
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9895bf5d:

    # le "I know. I've been sitting in them."
    le "我知道。我坐过。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3570
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bfd85db4_1:

    # le "What's your name?"
    le "你叫什么名字？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3571
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_43cf3717:

    # nur "Maria."
    nur "玛利亚。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3572
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f3477524:

    # le "That's a good name. Did it find you or did someone pick it?"
    le "好名字。是它主动来找你的，还是别人挑的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3573
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_aaefc506:

    # nur "I... my parents picked it."
    nur "我……是我父母给我起的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3574
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_63b6eefd:

    # le "Oh. That works too."
    le "噢。确实也有那种情况。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3575
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_51a1c8db:

    # e "Alright, come on. Leave Maria alone."
    e "好了，走吧。别打扰玛利亚了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3576
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_364daba8:

    # le "I wasn't bothering her."
    le "我没有打扰她啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3577
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_487a9597:

    # nur "She really wasn't."
    nur "的确没有。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3579
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_09bc0cc8:

    # le "See you later, Maria."
    le "再见，玛利亚。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3580
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_285a3617:

    # nur "See you."
    nur "再见。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3584
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_180c23cd:

    # le "These are all flowers."
    le "这些全都是花。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3585
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4a6f6de7:

    # e "Mm-hm."
    e "嗯哼。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3586
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7733464f:

    # le "They're in order."
    le "还有规律。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3588
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_febd0de9:

    # e "Are they?"
    e "是吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3589
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_10b59fe1:

    # le "By color. See? Yellow, something that looks like peach, and then pink. Someone arranged them."
    le "颜色啊。你看，黄色，然后是桃子的颜色，最后是粉色。是有人特意摆的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3590
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7eac5b3f:

    # e "How's that in order? I think that's just decoration, Leah."
    e "这就叫有规律吗？我觉得这只是装饰而已，莉娅。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3591
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_93402872:

    # le "Decoration still has a reason. Someone definitely chose this order."
    le "装饰也是有规律的。肯定是有人特意选了这个顺序。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3592
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_23f8be0d:

    # e "... I'm confused."
    e "……我听不懂。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3593
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3528c76d:

    # le "Which one do you like?"
    le "你喜欢哪一种？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3594
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_16d30ddd:

    # e "I don't really have opinions about flowers."
    e "我对花没什么感觉。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3595
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_77ed3b22:

    # le "There you go again. You're really no fun."
    le "你又是这样。真是没意思。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3597
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5f96b286:

    # e "Then I'll pick the white one. Second row."
    e "那我就选白色的吧。第二排。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3598
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6e35423e:

    # le "Can you tell me why?"
    le "可以跟我说说原因吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3599
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ea2d8545:

    # e "It looks simple enough. It's not trying too hard to be a flower..."
    e "看着很简朴。没有那种花枝招展的感觉……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3600
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_26e7e434:

    # e "... Which is ironic."
    e "……有点讽刺的感觉。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3601
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0064a5e4:

    # le "Mm. Yeah. I can see that."
    le "嗯。是啊。我能懂。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3605
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fc8b5d33_1:

    # le "Oh..."
    le "噢……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3606
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_300fe769:

    # e "Your old friend."
    e "你的老朋友。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3607
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cc59f41c:

    # le "It owes me a correct drink."
    le "它还欠我一瓶正确的饮料。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3608
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1429c7ce:

    # e "Right..."
    e "是吗……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3609
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bbdf8529:

    # le "The one from school gave me grape juice when I pressed apple."
    le "我明明按的是苹果，可学校里那台却给了我葡萄汁。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3610
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_764ed50e:

    # e "Maybe you pressed the wrong button?"
    e "可能你按错按钮了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3611
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c38a3e32:

    # le "I pressed the right one. The machine had its own ideas."
    le "我没有按错。是那台机器不听话。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3612
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7bb8ae59:

    # e "Go on."
    e "按吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3615
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8af09f86:

    # le "Orange."
    le "橘子。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3617
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_831f7f9f:

    # le "I pressed peach one."
    le "我按的是桃子。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3619
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_86549dd9:

    # le "It gave me orange."
    le "它给了我橘子。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3621
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5a31743a:

    # le "Don't."
    le "不可以。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3622
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_884f1f14:

    # e "I'm not doing anything."
    e "我什么都没干啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3623
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6bdc812e:

    # le "Your face is doing something."
    le "你的表情明显不对劲。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3625
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e8f124fa:

    # le "I saw that."
    le "我看见了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3626
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7384b402:

    # e "Saw what? I'm looking at the wall."
    e "看见什么了？我在盯着墙看。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3627
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_eab6875c:

    # le "You're laughing."
    le "你在笑。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3628
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ab103ab6:

    # e "I'm not laughing."
    e "我没笑。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3629
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0a56349b:

    # le "Your shoulders are moving."
    le "你的肩膀在动。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3633
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b1290d5b:

    # e "... It's a little funny."
    e "……因为有点好笑。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3634
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f6f94b3e:

    # le "It's not funny. It's a pattern. Vending machines doesn't respect me."
    le "一点也不好笑。总是这样。自动售货机不尊重我。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3635
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8c608950:

    # e "Maybe it's just giving you what you need instead of what you want."
    e "或许它给你的不是你想要的，而是你需要的东西。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3637
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_76562d57:

    # le "That's what Dr. Park says."
    le "帕克医生也是这么说的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3638
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ba1a8a6c:

    # e "I mean... she's not wrong."
    e "她……说得有道理。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3639
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_da18f8de:

    # le "Don't take her side."
    le "别跟她站一边。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3640
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b4cb7bde:

    # le "... Orange isn't bad, though."
    le "……不过，橘子也不错。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3641
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f821dc9a:

    # e "Yeah. It's good for you."
    e "是啊。你喝了有好处。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3645
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_92fe94de:

    # le "These are definitely better."
    le "这些椅子绝对更舒服。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3646
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e2f265f7:

    # e "Than the ones in your room?"
    e "比你房间里的舒服？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3647
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_80962025:

    # le "Uh-huh. It's way better. Whoever picked these actually sat in one first."
    le "嗯哼。舒服多了。挑这些的人肯定是好好试坐过了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3649
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c28dcf47_2:

    # le "Emma?"
    le "艾玛？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3650
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_efe5222c:

    # e "Yeah?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3651
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4f09dfe4:

    # le "What did you want to be when you were little?"
    le "你小时候想当什么呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3652
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1f4b76ba:

    # e "... A vet."
    e "……兽医。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3653
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a9b69013:

    # le "Really?"
    le "真的吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3654
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d4c22957:

    # e "Only for about two weeks. Then I realized you have to touch the animals when they're sick, and some of them bite."
    e "也只持续了两个星期。然后我就发现，兽医必须碰生病的动物，有些动物还会咬人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3655
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1b2c87da:

    # le "So you quit?"
    le "所以你就辞职了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3656
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_21870426:

    # e "I was seven. It wasn't quitting. It was a career change."
    e "我那时候才七岁。那不叫辞职。是转行。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3657
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_13ad4533:

    # le "*giggles* A career change."
    le "*笑* 是叫转行啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3658
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9807dd8e:

    # le "What happened after the vet thing?"
    le "那兽医之后呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3659
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b9b1b3dc:

    # e "I wanted to be one of those people who travels everywhere with a suitcase and a notebook."
    e "我想当那种带着行李箱和笔记本到处旅行的人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3660
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_75e0065c:

    # le "What do they call it? A journalist?"
    le "那叫什么来着？记者？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3661
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c552fc36:

    # e "I didn't really know what it was. But something along that line."
    e "我当时也不太清楚那叫什么。不过大概就是那种感觉。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3662
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8dc94d21:

    # e "I just wanted to knock on doors in places I'd never been and ask people if they'd seen someone."
    e "我只是想四处去敲门，问开门的人有没有见过某个人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3663
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b44f6cee:

    # le "Seen who?"
    le "见过谁？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3664
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_86db93d8:

    # e "It's a secret."
    e "秘密。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3665
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_de0d6d35:

    # le "... Alright then. Keep your secrets."
    le "……好吧。不说就不说。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3666
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_68bea78b:

    # e "What about you? When you were little."
    e "你呢？你小时候想当什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3667
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_629f0e12:

    # le "I'm still little."
    le "我现在也挺小。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3668
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d6369807:

    # e "Littler, then."
    e "那就是比现在更小的时候。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3669
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0134abd6:

    # le "Oh, I wanted to draw maps."
    le "噢，我想画地图。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3670
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_daad6dd1:

    # e "Maps? The world map kind of maps?"
    e "地图？世界地图那种吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3671
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ffc336dd:

    # le "Not real maps. Made-up ones. Like... places that don't exist but feel like they should."
    le "不是真的地图。是编出来的。那种……实际并不存在，但感觉应该存在的地方。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3672
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b736bfb8:

    # le "I'd name the rivers and the mountains and the towns. Then every town had a mayor with a story."
    le "我想给河流，大山还有城镇起名字。然后再给每个镇子的镇长写故事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3673
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3a7d500c:

    # e "... Do you still draw them?"
    e "……你现在还会画吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3674
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_87830722:

    # le "No... Not anymore."
    le "不……不画了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3675
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_18fce065:

    # le "My diary used to have some in the back. But the pages got ruined when we moved houses once."
    le "以前我的日记里有不少。可惜有一次搬家的时候全丢了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3676
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cfe6ef90:

    # le "I kept the names, though. In my head."
    le "但那些名字我还记着。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3677
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_88f0c7c8:

    # e "Tell me one."
    e "跟我说一个。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3678
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_41fb10ed:

    # le "There was one called Fenhollow. It was next to a lake that looked different to everyone who saw it."
    le "有个地方叫做芬霍罗。旁边有个湖，这个湖在每个人眼里的样子都不一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3679
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3d2e5570:

    # e "Your imagination really surprises me."
    e "你的想象力真是不得了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3680
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1fa5018d:

    # le "Then the mayor's name was Constance. Then she had one rule: no one was allowed to lie on Tuesdays."
    le "然后那里的镇长叫康斯坦丝。她有一个规矩：所有人都不准在星期二撒谎。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3681
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e46d4253:

    # e "Just Tuesdays? Like a rest day?"
    e "只有星期二不行吗？就跟休息日一样？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3682
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4d6c1535:

    # le "Yeah. Lying is tiring. You need to rest from it sometimes."
    le "是啊。撒谎很累的。时不时就要歇一歇。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3684
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8ca7e0f0:

    # le "You're doing the face again."
    le "你又有那种表情了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3685
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cbd9fe1c:

    # e "What face?"
    e "什么表情？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3686
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fa3426bc:

    # le "The one where you're trying not to like something too much."
    le "那种尽量克制自己不要太喜欢某样东西的表情。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3687
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1abda376:

    # e "... I don't have that face."
    e "……我从来没有过那种表情。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3688
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_40ceff5a:

    # le "You had it when I gave you the drawing."
    le "我送你画的时候，你就是那种表情。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3689
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f1da9742:

    # le "And when I told you about the penguin."
    le "我和你说企鹅的事的时候也是。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3690
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3a712877:

    # le "And just now, with Fenhollow."
    le "还有刚刚，讲芬霍罗的时候。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3691
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8384c279:

    # e "You... You noticed all that?"
    e "你……你全都注意到了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3692
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4e43ef3a:

    # le "Uh-huh?"
    le "对啊？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3693
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dbcdfa39:

    # e "That's a little unsettling."
    e "有点离谱。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3694
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3b7a7b95:

    # le "Can I tell you something though?"
    le "……我可以跟你说一件事吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3695
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1409ec85:

    # e "Yeah. What is it?"
    e "当然。怎么了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3696
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3815dae9:

    # le "This is the first time I've been somewhere in this building that isn't my room or the exam room."
    le "这是我第一次到我的房间和检查室以外的地方。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3697
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d130a3de:

    # le "It's the same building, but it doesn't feel the same."
    le "还是同一个建筑，可感觉却不一样了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3698
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_36fb65b2:

    # e "Because of the chairs?"
    e "因为椅子吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3699
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_999dd019:

    # le "Because of you."
    le "因为你。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3701
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_65556082:

    # le "My room has you in it sometimes. But it also has the nurses, and the questions, and the door that keeps opening for people I don't know."
    le "你有时候也会去我的房间。可是那里还有护士，有问题，还有一扇经常被我不认识的人打开的门。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3702
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4c7e142b:

    # le "Down here, it's just us."
    le "在这里，只有我们两个。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3704
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8200fab6:

    # le "Am I weird?"
    le "我很奇怪吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3705
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a47aa0c7:

    # e "No. No, you're not."
    e "不奇怪。不，你一点也不奇怪。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3706
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_00f752d7:

    # le "You sure?"
    le "真的吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3707
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_de7ee991:

    # e "Of course. You just surprise me sometimes, that's all."
    e "当然。你只是偶尔会让我觉得有些惊讶。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3708
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f66f356d:

    # le "... Some people say I am."
    le "……有些人说我奇怪。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3709
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_61a4e500:

    # e "Trust me, you're not."
    e "说真的，你不奇怪。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3710
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_821f5f72:

    # le "... Alright. I believe you."
    le "……好。我相信你。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3711
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_558d0043:

    # e "Actually, we should head back up. June doesn't know we're down here."
    e "好了，我们该回去了。琼都不知道我们在这。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3712
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d4a1d3d4:

    # le "Five more minutes?"
    le "再玩五分钟？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3713
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f8e13669:

    # e "Leah..."
    e "莉娅……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3714
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c0d8d4a7:

    # le "Three."
    le "三分钟。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3715
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5e13c275:

    # e "... Alright. Three."
    e "……好。三分钟。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3716
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f77bccbc:

    # le "What's that?"
    le "那是什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3719
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_54671145:

    # e "Uhm... What was that for?"
    e "呃……你这是？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3720
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ea8a2f7e:

    # le "A thank you kiss."
    le "为了谢谢你。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3341
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9896f4b4:

    # e "Yeah, heading out now. Give me two minutes."
    e "嗯，这就走了。等我一会儿。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3342
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5b4bae57:

    # mc "How's she holding up?"
    mc "她情况怎么样？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3343
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_65be9f09:

    # e "She's doing good. I'll explain when I get there."
    e "情况很好。等我到了再细说。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3344
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dcb69a17:

    # e "Anyway, I'm on—"
    e "总之，我——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3346
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1ac0907d:

    # ju "Oh—"
    ju "噢——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3347
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cac9067e:

    # e "Sorry."
    e "抱歉。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3348
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d458cc20:

    # ju "No, that was me."
    ju "没事，怪我。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3350
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_24267586:

    # ju "Everything alright?"
    ju "一切都还好吧？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3351
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d9f2591b:

    # e "Yeah. Just stopped by."
    e "是的，我只是顺便来看看。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3352
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e9917ef4:

    # ju "Mm."
    ju "嗯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3355
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4e378064:

    # ju "*nods* Get home safe."
    ju "*点头* 一路顺风。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3358
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_48751cc6:

    # e "... Yeah. I'm on my way."
    e "……好。我在路上了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3370
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ac3b9a90:

    # frs "Boss. I got something."
    frs "老板。有进展了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3371
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2c0bcd73:

    # fr "Talk."
    fr "说。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3372
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9aba887c:

    # frs "She talked. Full interview—cooperated the whole way through."
    frs "她开口了。接受了完整的讯问——全程都很配合。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3373
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_079c111f:

    # frs "Locations, what the place smelled like, how many times she was moved. She answered most of it."
    frs "地点，那地方的味道，她被转移了几次等等。大多数问题都回答了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3374
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_eef79d79:

    # fr "And the rest?"
    fr "还有呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3375
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ec982db0:

    # frs "She described you. Said there was a man. That he was nice to her. That he reminded her of someone."
    frs "她提到了你。说有个男人。对她挺好的。还说她像你认识的一个人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3376
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dd9d8147:

    # frs "His sister."
    frs "也就是你妹妹。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3377
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c3a70392_4:

    # fr "..."
    fr "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3378
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72c0fa19:

    # fr "*exhales slowly* She remembered."
    fr "*慢慢吐气* 她想起来了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3379
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fe95ee75:

    # fr "She remembered..."
    fr "她想起来了……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3380
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4a3095e1:

    # fr "Do you know how many there were before her?"
    fr "你知道在她之前已经有过多少个人了吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3381
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2f25b38_2:

    # frs "..."
    frs "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3382
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4aeffa10:

    # fr "The one before Leah stopped speaking by the third week. Gutted out from the inside—took everything with it. I had to let her go."
    fr "莉娅之前的那一个，第三周开始就不说话了。像是从内到外都被掏空了一样——全都白费了。我只能把她给放了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3383
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2f25b38_3:

    # frs "..."
    frs "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3384
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4453cf43:

    # fr "The one before that lasted longer."
    fr "再前面的一个，坚持得要久一点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3385
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5189979f:

    # fr "She remembered the hair. The way Vi used to hum when she was nervous."
    fr "她想起来了头发的事。还有薇紧张的时候爱哼的歌。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3386
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_61e5470f:

    # fr "For a while I was certain she was the one. But she started to fight—and fighting ruins everything."
    fr "我差点以为就是她了。结果她却开始反抗——一反抗就把一切都给毁了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3387
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b4212723:

    # fr "Not one of them ever described me the way Leah did. \"The man who was nice.\" She's not afraid of me. Not even after everything."
    fr "她们都不会像莉娅那样说我。“一个挺好的男人。”她经历过那一切之后依然不怕我。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3388
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b4df661d:

    # fr "That means everything I built with her is still there."
    fr "这就代表我和她之间的感情全都还在。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3389
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9aa6690c:

    # frs "She's in protective custody. Hospital added security after Ashen. CPS has a caseworker on her. If we move now—"
    frs "她现在处在保护性监护之中。医院对她严加看管。CPS也派了专员去跟她的案子。如果我们现在行动——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3390
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8f5e8c4f:

    # fr "I'm not going to rip her out of there. She has to want to come home."
    fr "我没打算把她从那里带走。她必须自己主动想回家才可以。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3391
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bce32b7d:

    # frs "There's one more thing. The caseworker—she has a connection to both officers from Ashen."
    frs "还有一件事。那个CPS的专员——她跟从苍白俱乐部把莉娅救走的那两个警察都有关系。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3392
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f969b55c:

    # fr "Tell our contact to keep watching."
    fr "让我们的人继续监视。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3393
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_36b80c0d:

    # frs "Copy that, boss."
    frs "明白，老板。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3395
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_40f014a9:

    # fr "No more breaking, Vi. I just have to be patient this time."
    fr "不会再坏掉了，薇。这次我必须耐心一点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3402
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e42b4045:

    # mc "Em?"
    mc "小艾？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3403
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0fba19b8_2:

    # e "Hm?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3404
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_15:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3405
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7e5be565_1:

    # e "What?"
    e "怎么了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3406
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a2791dae:

    # mc "Nothing. You good?"
    mc "没什么。你没事吧？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3407
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_92f16cc0_3:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "是啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3416
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6d280176:

    # ela "Tell me we have some creamer left in here."
    ela "可千万别告诉我奶精用完了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3417
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0bda3cb0:

    # e "We don't."
    e "是用完了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3418
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a5ca62b1:

    # ela "We always have creamer."
    ela "我们的奶精从来没用完过。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3419
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8c038449:

    # e "Chen finished it yesterday."
    e "昨天全被陈给用掉了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3420
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_db07529e:

    # ela "Of course he did."
    ela "我就知道是他。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3423
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bbb52946:

    # ela "Ugh... This tastes like a parking garage."
    ela "唉……喝起来跟刷锅水一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3424
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cef4e88e:

    # e "It's the same coffee we always have."
    e "我们一直都喝的是这款咖啡啊。"

