    cap "寄养，听证会，以及那个女孩接下来的境遇——这些都和你无关。不是你该操心的事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3679
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1ce7052b:

    # cap "The kindest thing you can do for that child right now is close this end clean and let the right people sort the rest."
