# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5216
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5ad2b33b:

    # fr "Four months of her learning to trust a place. Learning to trust a voice."
    fr "四个月的时间，让她学会信任一个地方。信任一个声音。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5217
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2717d645:

    # fr "You had her for a few days."
    fr "你只和她一起待了几天。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5218
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2831dd49:

    # mc "A few days were enough to see what four months looked like on her."
    mc "几天时间足够看出来她这四个月过得怎么样了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5220
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c3017b75:

    # fr "She reminds me of my sister."
    fr "她很像我妹妹。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5222
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0bb516ae:

    # fr "She used to follow me everywhere. Wanted to do everything I did."
    fr "她以前不管我到哪都会跟着我。不管我做什么都会模仿我。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5223
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_637ff282:

    # fr "I told her to wait inside once. I told her I'd be right back."
    fr "有一次我让她在房间里等我。我说我很快就会回来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5225
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_10554933:

    # wait "Can I get you anything?"
    wait "要点单吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5226
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dc44d798:

    # fr "Coffee. Black, please."
    fr "来一杯黑咖啡吧，谢谢。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5227
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8dd924bf:

    # wait "Sure thing. Refill for you, hon?"
    wait "没问题。你要续杯吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5228
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_34cd6e17:

    # mc "I'm good."
    mc "不用了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5229
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d8dd3e2e:

    # wait "Be right back."
    wait "我马上回来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5231
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6bd6a2b4_1:

    # mc "Francis."
    mc "弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5232
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e96ac12b:

    # fr "Hm?"
    fr "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5233
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_57ecbc71:

    # mc "What do you really want?"
    mc "你到底想说什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5234
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c3a70392_5:

    # fr "..."
    fr "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5235
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0c91e40d:

    # fr "I want you to understand something."
    fr "我想让你明白一件事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5236
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_11455b53_4:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "什么事？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5237
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dc435192:

    # fr "I'm not hurting them."
    fr "我没有伤害她们。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5238
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5565efcf:

    # mc "A ten-year-old girl. Basement. Candy jar. Real homey setup you had going."
    mc "一个十岁的小女孩被关在地下室里，旁边再放个糖果罐。这场景够温馨的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5239
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7231ecf0:

    # fr "I gave her somewhere safe and quiet. I took care of her."
    fr "我给了她一个安全又安静的住处。我好好照顾了她。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5240
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_be683774:

    # mc "Right. Because nothing says \"taken care of\" like a cheap mattress in an isolated room."
    mc "没错啊。孤零零的房间里放一张便宜床垫，简直是“好好照顾”的典范。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5241
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_25079b86:

    # fr "Until I could find what was missing."
    fr "那只持续到我找到缺失的部分为止。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5243
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0e574dce:

    # yt "He's different."
    yt "他变了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5244
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9a8e5b5d:

    # yt "Not the same guy who stood over me and said \"make it hurt\" like he was reading from a script."
    yt "不再是那个居高临下，像读台词一样对我说出“越疼越好”的人了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5245
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_abd45ae8:

    # yt "That Francis wanted a reaction. This one doesn't. That bothers me more."
    yt "那个弗朗西斯想看到回应。但这个并不想。这反而让我更担心了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5247
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ec7e0a37:

    # wait "Here you go."
    wait "请慢用。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5248
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_90a640e6:

    # fr "Thank you."
    fr "谢谢。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5250
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e9c6257a:

    # mc "She's not a missing piece, Francis. She's just a kid."
    mc "她不是什么缺失的部分，弗朗西斯。她只是个孩子。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5251
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bf4e0c35:

    # fr "I know what she is. I also know what she carries. Whether she knows it or not."
    fr "我知道她是什么人。我也知道她背负着什么。虽然她自己可能并不清楚。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5252
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bfeb7989:

    # mc "Yeah? She carries what happens when the person who was supposed to protect her puts a price tag on her instead."
    mc "是吗？她背负的事情就是被本该保护自己的人给卖掉换钱了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5253
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_21269668:

    # mc "That's her whole load right there. Nothing else."
    mc "除此之外没有别的了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5254
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c3a70392_6:

    # fr "..."
    fr "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5255
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ef15e217:

    # fr "Father used to tell me that there's more to this world than what it lets on."
    fr "父亲过去常跟我说这个世界远没有那么简单。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5256
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2e010b6a:

    # fr "That some people are born carrying things they didn't choose."
    fr "有人生来就会背负自己没有期望过的东西。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5257
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_12360551:

    # fr "Old debts, memories, names. He said most of them never even figure it out."
    fr "过去欠的债，记忆，名字。他说大多数人甚至从来没有弄清楚过。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5260
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e67fe030:

    # fr "You know what the difference is between you and me?"
    fr "你知道你和我的区别在哪里吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5261
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_26:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5262
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2450d92:

    # fr "When the rules said no..."
    fr "当规则不允许的时候……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5263
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0569fa34:

    # fr "You stopped."
    fr "你会停手。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5266
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_27:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5267
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_17b85725:

    # mc "*scoffs*"
    mc "*嗤笑*"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5270
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b4daca8c:

    # j "[mc]."
    j "[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5271
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_37bdc632:

    # mc "I need Eliza again."
    mc "我又需要伊莉莎帮忙了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5272
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ab200dc8:

    # j "What's going on?"
    j "出什么事了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5273
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_80c6c28d:

    # mc "Our unfinished business."
    mc "是我们的未竟之事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5274
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_55fe65cd:

    # j "Ours... or yours?"
    j "我们的……还是你的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5275
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6bd6a2b4_2:

    # mc "Francis."
    mc "弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5276
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b4fa3fc0:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5277
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2779f5ab:

    # j "I'll get her down. Come when you're ready."
    j "我会通知她。你准备好就过来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5284
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8ea907fc:

    # el "[mc]."
    el "[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5285
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bf4711a0:

    # el "Here."
    el "这边。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5286
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cff8c2a2:

    # el "A message from Jess."
    el "婕斯有话要告诉你。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5287
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8878c09d:

    # mc "What'd she say?"
    mc "她说什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5288
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ca4be637:

    # el "\"Don't go thinking there's always an easy way through.\""
    el "“别以为什么事都有捷径。”"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5289
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_28:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5290
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ebea1e68:

    # mc "Believe me. I tried to do it the right way this time."
    mc "说真的，我这次的确是尽力用正规的办法了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5291
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_db11fc91:

    # mc "Besides... I've always been the side character. Always have been."
    mc "而且……我一直都是个配角。一直都是。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5292
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a48c208f:

    # el "Glad to hear that. Good enough for me."
    el "听你这么说我就满意了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5299
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_139786ba:

    # e "You've been cooperative so far."
    e "你目前为止都很配合。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5300
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cbeba219:

    # tim "Didn't see the point in not being."
    tim "我不知道为什么要不配合。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5301
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cdc6d337:

    # e "Smart."
    e "聪明。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5302
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f8d87799:

    # tim "... The kid. She okay?"
    tim "……那个孩子，她还好吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5303
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6498fc3b:

    # e "Why do you ask?"
    e "你问这个干嘛？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5304
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a6a5502a:

    # tim "I want to know."
    tim "我想知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5305
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_84259102:

    # tim "I was the one feeding her. Making sure she had what she needed."
    tim "我就是负责给她吃饭的人。尽量满足她的要求。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5306
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_940e5bc7:

    # tim "Wasn't much, but... I made sure she ate."
    tim "这不算什么，但是……我让她吃饱了饭。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5307
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_78:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5308
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e7e0d27e:

    # tim "She used to save half her food."
    tim "她吃饭常常只吃一半。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5309
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0f829ce4:

    # e "What for?"
    e "为什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5310
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dd68af8c:

    # tim "Don't know. She just always did. Like she was keeping it for someone."
    tim "不知道。她就是总会剩下一半。好像是特意给某人留着。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5311
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_79:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5312
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_06d57ee7:

    # tim "She okay or not?"
    tim "她现在到底过得好不好？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5313
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cb67fe18:

    # e "She's safe."
    e "她很安全。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5314
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e275190d:

    # tim "Detective... I need to know. Please."
    tim "警官……我很想知道。求你了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5315
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_80:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5316
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_996ea6e0:

    # e "She's okay."
    e "她挺好的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5317
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_73fb2e84:

    # tim "*exhales* Good. Good..."
    tim "*叹气* 那就好。那就好……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5318
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_efa58b33:

    # tim "... She's a smart kid. Weird, but smart."
    tim "……她是个聪明的孩子。很奇怪，但也聪明。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5319
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_97f252d9:

    # e "Weird how?"
    e "怎么奇怪？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5320
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4c9bf64b:

    # tim "The way she talked. It's like she was always thinking three things at once."
    tim "说话的方式奇怪。就好像她一直在一心三用一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5321
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6a8d5752:

    # tim "Asked me once why I was doing this job."
    tim "她问过我为什么要干这种工作。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5322
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_79649566:

    # e "What did you tell her?"
    e "你怎么回答的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5323
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6b8724e5:

    # tim "The truth. Money."
    tim "说的实话。为了钱。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5324
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_364fa104:

    # tim "She thought about it for a second and said, \"that makes sense, I guess.\""
    tim "她想了一秒，然后说，“倒也是”。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5325
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6d49aa9a:

    # tim "*soft laugh* Ten years old. Just... \"that makes sense.\""
    tim "*轻笑* 一个十岁的小孩。说……“倒也是”。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5326
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_81:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5332
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f5c434e7:

    # el "Okay. Talk to me."
    el "行了。说说吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5333
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c991e3f4:

    # mc "Hospital database. GC General."
    mc "我想看GC综合医院的数据库。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5334
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_40c0fedc:

    # el "Patient records?"
    el "病历吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5335
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4a7d423e:

    # mc "All of it. Access logs, file movement, copy requests."
    mc "全都看。访问记录，文件改动，还有复制请求。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5336
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_445071c2:

    # el "Copy requests specifically?"
    el "连复制请求也要？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5337
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_da5fe03f:

    # mc "Someone inside that hospital is feeding information out. I need to know who."
    mc "那家医院里有内鬼往外走漏消息。我要找出来那个人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5338
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_76a50bf4:

    # el "You got a name? Ward? Department?"
    el "有名字吗？哪个科室，哪间病房？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5339
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_76451744:

    # mc "Pediatric recovery. Let's go with last two weeks."
    mc "儿科。最近两个星期。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5340
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ab8706ae:

    # el "Patient?"
    el "病人呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5341
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_32f31aa6:

    # mc "Leah Warren. Trafficking case, protective custody."
    mc "莉娅·沃伦。拐卖案件的受害者，接受保护性监护。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5342
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_885597a0:

    # el "..."
    el "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5343
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_90f2c898:

    # el "Sensitive file. That's going to have extra encryption layers on top of the standard hospital network."
    el "这是敏感的文件。除开医院常规的保护之外还会有额外的加密。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5344
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_19f56b3b:

    # el "GC General runs Medicore V4 on their backend. Government-adjacent, not government-grade."
    el "GC医院后端用的是中等水平的V4模型。跟政府联合研发的，但没有政府用的真家伙那么厉害。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5345
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_826b5892:

    # mc "Meaning?"
    mc "意思是？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5346
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7eba7423:

    # el "Meaning I can get in. Just won't be in the next thirty seconds."
    el "意思是我能搞定。只是没办法30秒就搞定。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5347
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_56c974f3:

    # mc "How long?"
    mc "要多久？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5348
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_308ff8fb:

    # el "Depends on whether they patched their north node since we last had reason to look at them."
    el "取决于我上次黑进去之后，他们有没有加固北方节点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5349
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cb14b2b9:

    # el "If they didn't, five to ten minutes. If they did, longer."
    el "如果没有的话，五到十分钟。有的话，再久点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5350
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_19e9ac30:

    # mc "Get started."
    mc "开始吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5353
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8f9708bb:

    # el "Going in through the auxiliary network first. Less traffic, easier to bury the entry point."
    el "先从辅助网络进去。流量少，更容易掩盖接入点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5354
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e6b0428b:

    # el "Once I'm past the outer firewall I can pull the access logs directly."
    el "等我绕过外部防火墙之后，就能直接看到访问记录了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5355
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e8d9f86d:

    # el "You're looking for anomalous access patterns. Someone pulling a file they have no clinical reason to pull."
    el "你要找的是异常的访问记录。有人看了完全没有理由看的文件。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5356
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d187ae5d:

    # mc "And copying it."
    mc "还复制了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5357
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_42f56f8b:

    # el "Copying is a different flag entirely."
    el "复制会留下另一种痕迹。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5358
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4e791f26:

    # el "If someone copied that file, there'll be a shadow log. Hospitals keep those for liability."
    el "如果有人复制那个文件的话，会生成一份隐藏记录。这是医院的追责机制。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5359
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_35d13fc5:

    # el "Most people don't know that."
    el "大多数人都不知道这事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5360
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_229fb293:

    # mc "Does Francis?"
    mc "弗朗西斯知道吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5361
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_969f9855:

    # el "Doesn't matter if he does. His possible contact inside won't."
    el "他知不知道都无所谓。他在医院里的人肯定不知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5362
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b62acfca:

    # el "People get sloppy when they think they're invisible."
    el "人一旦觉得自己躲在暗处，就会放松警惕。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5365
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e8321bc5:

    # el "I'm past the outer layer. Routing through a blind relay so the trace dies at the node."
    el "我已经攻破外部层了。现在用盲中继路由一下流量，让他们的追踪过不了这个节点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5366
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2f537aea:

    # el "Give me a few minutes on the inner partition."
    el "给我几分钟时间，我处理一下内部的分区。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5367
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_29:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5373
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_811e2015:

    # e "Francis Mentzelopoutous."
    e "弗朗西斯·门泽拉普图斯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5374
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e802950e:

    # tim "Yeah."
    tim "嗯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5375
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4e505ebe:

    # e "How long have you worked for him?"
    e "你给他干活多久了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5376
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_55e2ade8:

    # tim "Eight months. Almost nine."
    tim "八个月。马上九个月了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5377
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e2d37f1b:

    # e "How'd you get recruited?"
    e "你怎么认识他的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5378
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_96eb7ae8:

    # tim "Same way everyone does. Someone knows someone. Money's good. You don't ask questions."
    tim "跟其他人一样。口口相传。说是给钱很多。所以不会多问。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5379
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f72ee04b:

    # e "Did you know what the operation was before you signed on?"
    e "你入伙之前知道会干什么吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5380
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_db9bcfdb:

    # tim "... I had a pretty good idea."
    tim "……我大概都猜到了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5381
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_25afb0ea:

    # e "And you took the job anyway."
    e "但你还是干了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5382
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3a048ed4:

    # tim "Detective, I've got two kids and a landlord who doesn't give a shit about either of them."
    tim "警官，我有两个孩子，还有个除了钱什么都不在乎的房东。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5383
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_28fc6b8b:

    # tim "So yeah. I took the job."
    tim "所以，是啊。我还是干了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5384
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_82:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5385
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_abc4786c:

    # e "What can you tell me about him?"
    e "给我讲讲他的情况。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5386
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c29dc753:

    # tim "What do you want to know?"
    tim "你想知道什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5387
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_31acc078:

    # e "Everything."
    e "一切。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5388
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e35a6d4a:

    # tim "..."
    tim "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5389
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b6a1b370:

    # tim "He's not right."
    tim "他不正常。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5390
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b75c5c16:

    # e "Elaborate."
    e "仔细讲讲。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5391
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bc7ae638:

    # tim "In the head. He's not right in the head."
    tim "是脑子。他脑子不正常。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5392
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_806e7b6a:

    # tim "You see, most guys running an operation like this, they're businessmen. Cold, yeah, but businessmen."
    tim "你看，大多数干这种事的人，都是生意人。很冷血，但目的是赚钱。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5393
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_30eb6d86:

    # tim "Francis isn't running a business. It's something personal."
    tim "弗朗西斯做的不是生意。而是私事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5394
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_59f59c44:

    # tim "He doesn't care about the money. Barely touches it."
    tim "他不在乎钱。几乎都没碰过。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5395
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4018c761:

    # tim "The whole thing—the network, the locations, all of it—it's just infrastructure for whatever he's actually after."
    tim "整个产业——人手，基地，所有东西——都只是让他实现真正目的的工具。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5396
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f3a123dd:

    # e "Which is?"
    e "那他的目的是？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5397
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dfe86501:

    # tim "Looking for someone."
    tim "找人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5398
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0617fdd7:

    # e "Who?"
    e "谁？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5399
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ebed53be:

    # tim "His sister."
    tim "他妹妹。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5400
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_83:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5401
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_47b4943e:

    # tim "She's dead. Has been for a long time, from what I gathered."
    tim "她已经死了。根据我听说的情况来看，已经死了很久。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5402
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ee4bcc09:

    # tim "Fire. He was a kid. Got out. She didn't."
    tim "听说是他们小时候遇上了火灾。他跑掉了，他妹妹没有。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5403
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e8857347:

    # tim "He never got over it."
    tim "他一直没走出来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5404
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_77f9d702:

    # e "And the children—"
    e "那他绑架小孩——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5405
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f227abf6:

    # tim "He's trying to put her back together."
    tim "他是想把她重新拼出来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5406
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_84:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5407
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_07e694cd:

    # tim "That's the best way I can describe it."
    tim "这是我能想到的最好的说法了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5408
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_403cceda:

    # tim "Every kid that came through, he'd sit with them. Talk to them. Real quiet, real patient."
    tim "每带来一个孩子，他都会坐下来，跟她们说话。很安静，很耐心。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5409
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_add7bee3:

    # tim "Looking for something specific. The way she moved. Something she said. The way she laughed. Like he was collecting pieces."
    tim "他是想看到某样特定的东西。比如跟她一样的动作。她说过的话。她笑起来的样子。就好像在收集碎片一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5410
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_99eda18e:

    # e "Pieces?"
    e "碎片？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5411
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_aa0e6687:

    # tim "One had the right voice. One had the right eyes. One remembered something she shouldn't have."
    tim "有人的声音对得上号。有人的眼睛很像。还有人记起来了本不该知道的事情。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5412
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cd9a7760:

    # tim "None of them were ever... enough."
    tim "但没有一个……完全符合。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5413
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_93ef63f5:

    # tim "And when they weren't..."
    tim "而一旦那个小孩表现不好……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5414
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_29119fb4:

    # e "He lost interest."
    e "他就失去兴趣了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5415
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e802950e_1:

    # tim "Yeah."
    tim "是啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5416
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e599524a:

    # e "And then what happened to them?"
    e "那之后，孩子们会怎么样？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5417
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e35a6d4a_1:

    # tim "..."
    tim "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5418
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e6a286b2:

    # tim "Moved on. That's all I know."
    tim "被送走。我只知道这么多。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5419
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a2106ff0:

    # e "Moved on where?"
    e "送去哪里？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5420
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e3c4d8ae:

    # tim "I didn't ask. You learn real fast not to ask."
    tim "我没问过。任谁都知道不要多问。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5421
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_85:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5422
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b079d30c:

    # e "The sister. Did she actually exist?"
    e "那个所谓的妹妹。她真的存在吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5423
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e35a6d4a_2:

    # tim "..."
    tim "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5427
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_daea9950:

    # el "I'm in the access logs."
    el "我看到访问记录了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5428
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_49321285:

    # el "Pulling pediatric recovery. Last fourteen days."
    el "让我看看儿科最近14天的情况。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5429
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_885597a0_1:

    # el "..."
    el "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5430
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2087395:

    # el "Okay. I've got twenty-three unique access events on the file you're looking for."
    el "嗯，你说的文件有二十三次独特访问记录。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5431
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_14c79159:

    # el "Seventeen are clinical. Doctors, nurses, attending staff. All timestamped within standard shift hours."
    el "十七次是医生、护士和其他员工出于医学目的调用的。时间戳也都是正常上班时间。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5432
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a4a49220:

    # el "The other six..."
    el "剩下六次……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5433
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c63e49c1:

    # mc "What about them?"
    mc "怎么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5434
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_edce20c7:

    # el "Off-hours. Three between midnight and 4 AM. Two during shift change—lowest surveillance window in any hospital."
    el "时间不正常。三次是凌晨，两次是在换班时间——这在任何医院都是警备最松懈的时候。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5435
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2bd12689:

    # el "One this morning."
    el "还有一次在今天上午。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5436
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_04cd948c:

    # mc "This morning."
    mc "今天上午？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5437
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_57f698b2:

    # el "About two hours ago."
    el "大概两个小时之前。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5438
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_30:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5439
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7b0be15d:

    # el "And there's your copy flag."
    el "然后，还有你想看的复制记录。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5440
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4f5a2771:

    # el "Someone used a local terminal on the pediatric floor to export the file."
    el "有人用儿科的终端导出了文件。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5441
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_900b6230:

    # el "Not to an external drive. To an encrypted relay address."
    el "没有导出到外部硬盘上，而是导出到了一个加密的中继地址。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5442
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_31e912d0:

    # el "Whoever set this up knew what they were doing."
    el "这个人还算是懂点东西。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5443
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e3c6dccf:

    # el "But they used the same terminal every time."
    el "但每次用的都是同一个终端。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5444
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1bc09cae:

    # mc "Can you get a name from the terminal ID?"
    mc "你能用终端的ID查到是谁吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5445
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4a414ca0:

    # el "Already running it."
    el "已经在查了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5446
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_885597a0_2:

    # el "..."
    el "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5447
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_527dc5dd:

    # el "Staff login tied to that terminal."
    el "那个终端是有专人使用的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5448
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_885597a0_3:

    # el "..."
    el "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5449
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_516979d5:

    # el "Cara Voss. Registered nurse. Pediatric recovery."
    el "卡拉·沃斯。儿科护士。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5450
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a98d5871:

    # mc "She's been in the room with Leah since the first night."
    mc "她从第一天晚上开始就一直在莉娅身边。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5451
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_885597a0_4:

    # el "..."
    el "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5452
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c89551a1:

    # el "You want me to pull her full profile?"
    el "需要把她的档案全调出来吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5453
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bf1c7709:

    # mc "Everything you can get."
    mc "越多越好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5454
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7e71e9b0:

    # el "Give me two minutes."
    el "等我两分钟。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5458
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_13748cd7:

    # tim "I don't know."
    tim "我不知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5459
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e5c9da4c:

    # tim "Eight months working for this man and I've never seen a photo. Never heard a last name. Never heard anyone else mention her."
    tim "我给这个人干了八个月的活，从来没见过她的照片。从来没听到过她姓什么。也从来没听到过别人提起她。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5460
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f08423b2:

    # tim "Just him. Talking to himself about her like she's standing right there."
    tim "只有他一个人，自言自语，好像她就在身边一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5461
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_391e4f7d:

    # tim "I think... I think she might just be something he built in his head to survive whatever happened to him."
    tim "我觉得……她可能只是他为了弥补创伤，幻想出来的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5462
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5989d014:

    # tim "But good luck telling him that."
    tim "但他绝对不可能承认。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5463
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_86:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5464
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4d1d3be2:

    # tim "The creepy part isn't that he's looking for her."
    tim "最诡异的不是他铁了心要找到她。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5465
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2d75c8e0:

    # tim "The creepy part is he genuinely believes he's close."
    tim "而是他真心觉得自己快成功了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5466
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_444592bb:

    # tim "Every single time. Always thinks he's close."
    tim "每次都是这样。他每次都觉得这次会成功。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5467
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_67dfe6c8:

    # e "And Leah?"
    e "那莉娅呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5468
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_49c60746:

    # tim "Closest he's ever gotten, far as I could tell."
    tim "据我所知，是最接近成功的一次。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5469
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_87:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5470
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dc094078:

    # e "He spent more time with her than the others?"
    e "他在莉娅身边的时间比其他人要久吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5471
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e802950e_2:

    # tim "Yeah."
    tim "对。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5472
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1ea97b2d:

    # e "Why?"
    e "为什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5473
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e6773dac:

    # tim "Don't know. But he was different with her."
    tim "不知道。但他对莉娅的态度明显不一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5474
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3140ff6e:

    # tim "He was calmer. Like he thought she was it—or whatever it is that's going on in that head of his."
    tim "他会更平静。就好像他觉得她就是那个人。也可能不是，没人知道他脑子里的想法。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5475
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_88:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5476
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e4b5c39b:

    # e "The men who stayed. Why?"
    e "其他的手下又为什么继续给他干活？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5477
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f34a30b2:

    # tim "Same reason I did. He pays well and on time."
    tim "原因跟我一样。他给钱又多又准时。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5478
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cb69d0fc:

    # tim "Nobody's really loyal to him. He just keeps the money flowing and people keep showing up."
    tim "没人是真的对他忠心。他只是不断用钱买来人手而已。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5479
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_25ca02ae:

    # tim "Pull the money out and the whole thing falls apart overnight."
    tim "一旦没了钱，所有人都会立马走掉。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5480
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_64cf238a:

    # tim "But him? He'd keep going with nothing. I genuinely believe that."
    tim "可他呢？他哪怕一无所有也会继续。我真心这么想。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5481
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_89:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5484
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b728fd37:

    # e "Where is he?"
    e "他在哪？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5485
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ac8f0e6a:

    # tim "... You're going to find him anyway."
    tim "……反正你迟早会找到他。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5486
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e26741b8:

    # e "Faster with your help."
    e "有你帮忙会更快一点。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5487
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e35a6d4a_3:

    # tim "..."
    tim "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5488
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e6276203:

    # tim "Funny thing is, he's just a few miles away from Ashen. East end, near the train station. He's got an office there."
    tim "其实，他的藏身处离苍白俱乐部不远。在东边，火车站附近。他在那有间办公室。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5489
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_21366114:

    # tim "He moves around but he keeps coming back. It's where he feels safe, I think."
    tim "他经常四处转移，但总是会回到那里。我想他大概放不下那个地方。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5490
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ff250a81:

    # e "How many men?"
    e "那里有多少人？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5491
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cb74c714:

    # tim "Skeleton crew by now. After Ashen, most of them probably scattered."
    tim "没几个人了。大多数人在苍白俱乐部的事情之后都跑了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5492
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_06e87e04:

    # tim "Maybe seven. Maybe less."
    tim "可能有七个。也可能更少。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5493
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0af36474:

    # e "Thank you."
    e "谢谢。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5494
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8148763d:

    # tim "Detective."
    tim "警官。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5495
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_efe5222c_1:

    # e "Yeah?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5496
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_00ff8c5b:

    # tim "Thank you for getting her out of there."
    tim "谢谢你把她救了出去。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5497
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_90:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5498
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_47f9988b:

    # e "She saved herself. We just opened the door."
    e "是她自己救了自己。我们只是打开了门。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5504
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7f7f7a93:

    # el "Okay. Cara Voss. Licensed RN, seven years. She's got a clean record, no flags."
    el "卡拉·沃斯，持证注册护士，七年工作经验。她的档案很干净，没有异常。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5505
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b50f7548:

    # el "Hired at GC General fourteen months ago."
    el "十四个月之前来到GC综合医院工作。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5506
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_88a63528:

    # el "Previous employer—private medical contractor. Dissolution Medical Services."
    el "上一任雇主是私人医疗承包商。“分解”医疗服务公司。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5507
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_128ec3e3:

    # el "Which is interesting, because Dissolution Medical Services doesn't exist anymore."
    el "还挺有意思的，因为分解医疗服务公司已经不存在了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5508
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f82b7b2c:

    # el "Dissolved—right there in the name—eighteen months ago."
    el "十八个月以前，就“分解”了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5509
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c4f6c6a5:

    # el "But here's the thing... The registered address for Dissolution Medical Services?"
    el "但重点是……这家公司的注册地址。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5511
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_71bfe3f9:

    # el "Few miles from Club Ashen."
    el "离苍白俱乐部只有几公里。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5512
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_31:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5513
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a4dfb4e4:

    # mc "He planted her before Leah even got there."
    mc "他早在莉娅入院之前，就把卡拉安排进去了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5514
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f7f75036:

    # el "Looks that way."
    el "看来是这样的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5515
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_074a590e:

    # el "She wasn't placed for Leah specifically."
    el "她不是专门为了莉娅安排的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5516
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fa4d7484:

    # el "She was already there. Waiting for whoever came through."
    el "她只是在那里，等待着被送来的任意一个孩子。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5517
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_32:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5518
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e99f7434:

    # el "You want us to act on this? Just say the word."
    el "你需要我们行动吗？只要说一声就好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5526
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e16f5e87:

    # e "[mc]."
    e "[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5527
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_11130935:

    # mc "Where are you?"
    mc "你在哪？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5528
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_43c83faf:

    # e "At the precinct. Just wrapped up an interrogation. I've got Francis's location—"
    e "在局里。刚审完犯人。我知道弗朗西斯在哪——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5529
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b080cd3c:

    # mc "Em. Hold on."
    mc "小艾。先等等。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5530
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7e5be565_4:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5531
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bc1759fb:

    # mc "The nurse. Cara Voss."
    mc "那个护士，卡拉·沃斯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5532
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4e93c1f6:

    # mc "She's Francis's contact. Has been since before Leah even got there."
    mc "她是弗朗西斯安插的间谍。早在莉娅去之前就是了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5533
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2e0f82aa:

    # mc "She's been copying Leah's file. Placement details. Visitor logs. Everything."
    mc "她一直在泄露莉娅的文件。寄养的细节，探视记录等等。全都泄出去了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5534
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_91:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5535
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_26b98142_1:

    # mc "Emma."
    mc "艾玛。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5536
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fb728e87:

    # e "The foster family. They're moving Leah right now."
    e "寄养家庭现在就正要把莉娅带走。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5537
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cf1adef2_5:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "是啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5538
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1de969fa:

    # e "He knows where they're taking her."
    e "他知道莉娅要被带到哪去。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5539
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_33:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5540
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1feed147:

    # mc "Em, I know what you're thinking—"
    mc "小艾，我知道你在想什么——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5541
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_244a8347:

    # e "Francis is a few miles east of Ashen. Office near the train station."
    e "弗朗西斯就在苍白俱乐部东边几公里的地方。在火车站附近的一间办公室里。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5542
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_38336411:

    # e "File that report now. Make sure the evidence is airtight."
    e "现在就去交报告。一定要确保证据确凿无疑。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5543
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7250f4b6_1:

    # mc "To who?"
    mc "交给谁？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5544
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_334af360:

    # e "Hale. Go straight to Hale."
    e "黑尔。直接去找黑尔。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5545
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5093c6a2:

    # mc "Emma—"
    mc "艾玛——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5546
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f3b38e9d:

    # e "[mc]. Please."
    e "[mc!t]。拜托。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5547
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_34:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5548
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1284c607:

    # e "File it. I'll buy you time."
    e "快去。我给你争取时间。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5549
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f7dde690:

    # mc "Em, if you go there now—"
    mc "小艾，如果你现在过去——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5550
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_76d3b639:

    # e "I know what it'll cost..."
    e "我知道代价是什么……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5551
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3410ea8e:

    # mc "Let us handle this."
    mc "交给我们处理吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5552
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_62c7d423:

    # e "You already are..."
    e "你已经在处理了……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5563
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cb4c857d_1:

    # ju "Emma—"
    ju "艾玛——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5565
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_688d332c:

    # ju "What are you doing?"
    ju "你这是在做什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5566
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a9300c08:

    # e "Buying time."
    e "争取时间。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5567
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a5b831c5:

    # ju "You were removed from this case."
    ju "你已经和这个案子没有关系了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5568
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_637715b6:

    # e "Yeah. I know."
    e "嗯。我知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5570
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2a38350a:

    # le "Emma."
    le "艾玛。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5571
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0fba19b8_6:

    # e "Hm?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5572
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b929cca8:

    # le "I read your letter."
    le "我读了你的信。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5573
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_92:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5574
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_36089d2f:

    # ju "Emma. Step aside. Right now."
    ju "艾玛。赶紧让开。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5575
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_897e8c54:

    # e "There's a report being filed with Hale as we speak."
    e "现在正有人给黑尔提交报告。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5576
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6a3d427c:

    # ju "That doesn't give you the right to—"
    ju "就算那样，你也无权——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5577
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8e830dbe:

    # e "Cara Voss."
    e "卡拉·沃斯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5578
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_52fc4ea2_9:

    # ju "..."
    ju "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5579
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3904a7a5:

    # e "She's Francis's contact. She's been copying Leah's file."
    e "她是弗朗西斯的手下。她一直在泄露莉娅的文件。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5580
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cb10ddf6:

    # e "Visitor logs. Transfer schedule... and the placement details."
    e "探望记录。移交的时间安排……还有寄养的细节。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5581
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8b7e8b9c:

    # e "He knows where you're taking her, June."
    e "他知道你要把莉娅带到哪去，琼。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5582
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_52fc4ea2_10:

    # ju "..."
    ju "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5583
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_0432b236:

    # ju "Even if that's true, you don't have the authority to do this."
    ju "就算你说的是事实，你也依然没有权力做这种事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5585
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e2965941:

    # ju "Then step aside."
    ju "那就快让开。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5586
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_879634cc_1:

    # e "No."
    e "不行。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5587
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9049afb6:

    # ju "Emma... please. Let's not do this."
    ju "艾玛……拜托。不要无理取闹。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5588
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_93:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5589
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_edbce1d1:

    # ju "You were removed from this case for a reason."
    ju "我把你排除在外是有原因的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5590
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_62588d3a:

    # e "I know that too."
    e "这我也知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5591
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6a0d3e42:

    # ju "Then what are you doing?"
    ju "那你这是在做什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5592
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_94:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5593
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1e89a428:

    # e "I have a friend."
    e "我有一个朋友。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5594
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_26e04b40:

    # e "She would've walked into that club herself."
    e "她愿意单枪匹马闯进那个俱乐部。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5595
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e0520160:

    # e "No badge. No backup. Not even a sliver of hesitation."
    e "不需要警徽。不需要支援。甚至都不会有一丝犹豫。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5596
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f1d4cdf6:

    # e "Because that's just who she is."
    e "因为她就是这种人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5597
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_26bb4a1a:

    # e "She's stronger than me. Faster. Better equipped for all of it."
    e "她比我强得多。也快得多。有更好地处理这一切的能力。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5598
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_22b217bc:

    # e "And I used to tell myself that was fine."
    e "而我以前常常告诉自己，这样就够了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5599
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_942a8195:

    # e "That there were people better suited. That I'd done what I could."
    e "有更适合的人会去做。我只要做自己份内的事就行了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5600
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_52fc4ea2_11:

    # ju "..."
    ju "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5601
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3b0aec94:

    # e "I told myself that when Kei got taken."
    e "[mc!t]被绑架的时候，我就是这么告诉自己的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5602
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_40791b9e:

    # e "I knew something was wrong and convinced myself it wasn't my place."
    e "我知道出了大事，却还是说服了自己，那不是我该管的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5603
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2275141b:

    # e "That the right people were handling it."
    e "有更合适的人会去处理。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5604
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f7b0cfe1:

    # e "He got out. Everything was fine."
    e "他被救了出来。有惊无险。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5605
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7e97021d:

    # e "But I should've been there."
    e "但是，我应该去的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5606
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ef21ef6f:

    # e "It should've been me."
    e "去的人应该是我才对。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5607
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5bed0e19:

    # ju "Emma..."
    ju "艾玛……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5608
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b2acbbd2:

    # e "I'm not like her, June."
    e "我和她不一样，琼。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5609
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_464fddd4:

    # e "I can't move faster than a bullet or take a hit that would put anyone else in the ground."
    e "我没法比子弹还快，或者一招就把敌人放倒。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5610
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5da94a9d:

    # e "All I have is this job."
    e "我只有警察这份工作。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5611
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4ca9c4a1:

    # e "And if I can't use it to protect one child..."
    e "而如果我连一个孩子都没法保护的话……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5612
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f2964186:

    # e "Then what am I even doing here?"
    e "那我还当什么警察呢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5613
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a96b23a7:

    # e "What was any of it for?"
    e "这一切有什么意义？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5614
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_52fc4ea2_12:

    # ju "..."
    ju "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5615
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bc9e5e1f:

    # ju "Emma. That still doesn't justify—"
    ju "艾玛。这依然不是你——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5616
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_486b6af1:

    # e "I fell in love with her, June."
    e "我爱上她了，琼。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5618
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2b35b6fe_35:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5619
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8e0800a9:

    # el "You should tell her she left the call on."
    el "你怎么不跟她说她忘挂电话了呢。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5621
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8266de4e:

    # e "I didn't plan it. I didn't even see it coming. But by the time I did... I didn't want to stop it."
    e "这不是我计划好的事。我甚至根本没有想到会这样。可等我意识到了之后……我就根本停不下来了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5622
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9aa2df06:

    # e "That's your answer. That's why I'm standing here."
    e "这就是我的答案。这就是我为什么会站在这里。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5624
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f9ca0ad0:

    # ju "I hear you, Emma. But the law—"
    ju "我明白了，艾玛。可是法律——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5625
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5e0a3226:

    # e "The law doesn't know Francis has her transfer route."
    e "法律并不知道弗朗西斯掌握了她的去向。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5626
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_467224b6:

    # ju "The report will be processed—"
    ju "等到报告被处理完——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5627
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_924b3eac:

    # e "By the time it clears the right desks, she could already be back in his hands."
    e "等到管事的人读到那份报告的时候，她可能已经又落入弗朗西斯手里了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5628
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1cf4b251:

    # e "I'm not taking that chance. Not with Leah."
    e "我绝对不会让莉娅冒任何风险。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5634
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d1ddaffa:

    # "........"
    "…………"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5635
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_da41589f:

    # ju "Yeah. She's here."
    ju "嗯。她在这。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5636
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9ea6b0e1:

    # ".............."
    "………………"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5637
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_79667eac:

    # ju "You're certain, sir?"
    ju "你确定吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5638
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5639
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_be697db9:

    # ju "Okay."
    ju "好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5644
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e6100ee2:

    # li "Cara Voss."
    li "卡拉·沃斯。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5645
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e618e1e1:

    # cara "... Yes?"
    cara "……怎么了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5646
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_63b5e84f:

    # y "Sicae. You're coming with us."
    y "我们是西卡的人。跟我们走。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5647
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cf436002:

    # cara "I— what? Why?"
    cara "我——怎么回事？为什么啊？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5648
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a9d4aeb9:

    # li "Oh, please... don't make things harder for yourself."
    li "行了……别给你自己找麻烦。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5650
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_505527fa:

    # cara "What— I don't— what is this?! I haven't done anything!"
    cara "什么——我没有——这是怎么回事？！我什么都没做啊！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5651
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e4085cd6:

    # y "*sighs* Why do they always lead with that...?"
    y "*叹气* 为什么每个人都会说这几句话？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5652
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_97a87ceb:

    # li "Beats me."
    li "不知道。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5653
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_37dda789:

    # cara "I want a lawyer—"
    cara "我要律师——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5654
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d9739f1d:

    # li "That's not really how we work, hon."
    li "我们办事不讲那一套，亲。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5655
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d6fc17ff:

    # drp "What's— Cara?"
    drp "什么——卡拉？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5656
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1d5ea238:

    # cara "Dr. Park, help me! I don't know what's happening!"
    cara "帕克医生，救我啊！我不知道怎么回事！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5657
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6cefe1ab:

    # drp "What did she do?!"
    drp "她做什么了？！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5658
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_02c996e4:

    # y "Above your pay grade, Doctor."
    y "这不是你该关心的事，医生。"

