    # le "Promise?"
    le "你保证？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5692
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_98:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5693
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bde2d829:

    # e "Yeah. I promise."
    e "嗯。我保证。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5695
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_76e193ca_2:

    # e "*nods*"
    e "*点头*"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5710
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5a0fb43b_2:

    # cap "Meyer."
    cap "梅耶。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5711
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_50838fa4_1:

    # e "Sir."
    e "长官。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5713
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_35402734:

    # cap "Badge. Weapon. ID."
    cap "警徽。配枪。证件。全部交上来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5714
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_99:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5716
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_42129614:

    # cap "As of this moment, you are terminated from the department."
    cap "你被开除了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5717
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_54ab8ef0:

    # cap "Grounds: insubordination, obstruction of an official DFCS proceeding, and conduct unbecoming of a sworn officer."
    cap "原因：违抗命令，妨碍DFCS官方程序，以及有损警官形象的行为。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5718
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ca280cb0:

    # cap "Your record will reflect all three."
    cap "这三条都会写进你的档案里。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5719
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_100:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5720
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_16fff1de:

    # cap "Any future application to law enforcement—any department, any jurisdiction—will require a full disclosure review."
    cap "将来去任何执法部门应聘——不管是任何部门、任何辖区——都会把你的档案调出来，进行仔细、全面的审查。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5721
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b6b31bb9:

    # cap "You'll likely never hold a badge again."
    cap "你大概这辈子都没法再当警察了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5722
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_101:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5725
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_17691451:

    # cap "Is that the Francis location?"
    cap "这是弗朗西斯的位置吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5726
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_118adec5_1:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5727
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8a8972e9:

    # cap "I'll sign it."
    cap "我会处理的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5729
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_00ba4d98:

    # cap "Good work."
    cap "干得好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5730
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_58cb631e:

    # cap "For what it's worth."
    cap "虽然好不好都没意义了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5731
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_102:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5733
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3f119295:

    # cap "The Francis case will be handed to Sicae."
    cap "弗朗西斯的案子会移交给西卡侦办。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5734
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_71e065fc:

    # cap "Should've been theirs from the off, if I'm being honest."
    cap "要我说，一开始就该交给他们。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5735
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ece03b7a:

    # cap "The trafficking network, the sister, whatever he's actually after—"
    cap "走私集团，不存在的妹妹，还有他真正的目的——"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5736
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e5404963:

    # cap "That's not our standard jurisdiction. That's their world. We were always just on the fringes."
    cap "那些本就不是我们平常处理的事情。那是他们的世界。我们一直都只是边缘人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5737
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c0f9e00c:

    # cap "They'll see it through."
    cap "他们会好好处理的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5738
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_103:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5740
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2bd0d4ef:

    # cap "I've got four kids, Meyer."
    cap "我有四个孩子，梅耶。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5741
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_104:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5742
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_615c7648:

    # cap "Four."
    cap "四个。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5743
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6bdf790f:

    # cap "And I'd like to think I'd have done exactly what you did."
    cap "我认为我也愿意去做跟你一样的事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5745
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c668ba64:

    # cap "But I wouldn't have."
    cap "但是我不会真的去做。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5746
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a64a2f00:

    # cap "Because I know what this job demands. And so did you."
    cap "因为我知道这份工作对人的要求。你也一样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5747
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_731142ed:

    # cap "That's what makes this particularly hard to stomach."
    cap "所以才会那么难熬。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5749
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9dbe382e:

    # cap "I came up under a detective named Garcia."
    cap "我以前在一个名叫加西亚的警察手底下工作。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5750
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a3464f02:

    # cap "Twenty-two years on the force. Best I've ever seen."
    cap "他干了二十二年了。是我见过最棒的警察。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5751
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_1cba758d:

    # cap "Lost his badge over a case not entirely unlike this one."
    cap "他就是因为跟这件案子差不多的案子丢了警徽。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5752
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6f7cab3d:

    # cap "I watched him hand it over."
    cap "我亲眼看着他把警徽交了出去。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5753
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_827c7f4b:

    # cap "Told myself I'd never be the one on the other side of that desk."
    cap "我告诉自己，我绝对不会成为办公桌对面的那个人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5756
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d02ba5e3:

    # cap "But here we are."
    cap "可我们还是走到了这一步。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5757
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_105:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5758
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5050f549:

    # cap "Whatever happens with the child—that's no longer your concern. Professionally."
    cap "从职业的角度来说，那孩子之后会怎么样，就不是你该关心的了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5759
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_af52dc39:

    # cap "I trust you understand the distinction."
    cap "我相信你能明白其中的区别。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5760
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_358d1a49:

    # e "Yes, sir."
    e "是的，长官。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5762
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c9236608:

    # cap "You were one of the best I had, Meyer."
    cap "你曾经是我手底下最好的警察之一，梅耶。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5763
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4f474ef3:

    # cap "Don't make me regret saying that."
    cap "别让我后悔这么说。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5765
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_72a33094_106:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

