    le "噢……是那个漂亮的护士姐姐带来的。她来给我量血压的时候把它们放在了桌子上。我觉得她可能是觉得扎针的时候我会害怕。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3378
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9339f560:

    # le "Like right now, you look like you didn't finish your lunch."
    le "比如你现在看起来像是没有吃完午饭。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3510
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3b2773cd:

    # le "Emma? How long have I been in here?"
    le "艾玛？我来这里多久了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3515
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f1860f66:

    # le "... I see."
    le "……好吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3519
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3cc3b9be:

    # le "I don't like watching TV. And cartoons are so boring."
    le "我不喜欢看电视。动画片很无聊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3533
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d0bb053d:

    # e "Let's get your shoes on first."
    e "先给你把鞋穿好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3559
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_eefd4356:

    # le "They're okay. I guess it depends on the color."
    le "还行吧。看是什么颜色的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3570
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b0e3b608:

    # le "Hi!"
    le "嗨！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3571
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_14ca9548:

    # nur "Oh! Hello, sweetheart. Are you lost?"
    nur "噢！你好，小朋友。你迷路了吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3575
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6c3596bd:

    # nur "Oh, is that your mom?"
    nur "噢，是你妈妈吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3584
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ce086a00:

    # nur "Aw... that's sweet."
    nur "哎呀……真可爱。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3589
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7450e900:

    # nur "No worries. Enjoy the tour."
    nur "没关系。你们尽情逛吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3649
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5351290c:

    # le "Ironic? Why?"
    le "讽刺？为什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3650
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_27b5f2d5:

    # e "It's nothing... Let's just move somewhere else."
    e "没什么……我们去别处吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3686
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_caab060a:

    # le "Don't do that."
    le "不可以。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3733
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_91f1b80e:

    # e "I was five. It wasn't quitting. It was a career change."
    e "我那时候才五岁。那不叫辞职。是转行。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3738
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_848861da:

    # e "I wanted to be a detective, actually. My teachers gave me the idea. Said I was good at problem solving."
    e "我其实想当警察。是我的老师给的建议。她说我很擅长解决问题。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3739
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_daaa1651:

    # le "Wait, you actually became one, though."
    le "等等，你现在的确是警察啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3740
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a3a3eaa4:

    # e "Not right away. Somewhere in between, I wanted to be one of those people who travel everywhere with a suitcase and a notebook."
    e "中间有过波折。有一段时间，我想当那种带着行李箱和笔记本到处旅行的人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3749
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f58e2417:

    # le "So you went back to detective?"
    le "然后你就又想当警察了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3750
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2d93232b:

    # e "Eventually. Turns out knocking on doors and asking questions is most of the job anyway."
    e "是啊。最后还是当了警察。毕竟这个工作大部分时间也是敲门问问题。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3752
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fa5d3c6a:

    # le "So you got both."
    le "这是不是就叫一石二鸟？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3753
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_9a3f4174:

    # e "I guess I did."
    e "没错。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3784
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_cbf2e722:

    # le "You had it when I gave you the drawing. And when I told you about the penguin. And just now, with Fenhollow."
    le "我送你画的时候，你就是那种表情。我和你说企鹅的事的时候也是。还有刚刚，讲芬霍罗的时候。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3794
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8593fc45:

    # e "Let me guess, because of the chairs?"
    e "我猜猜，因为椅子吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3797
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2fe671ac:

    # le "My room has you in it sometimes. But it also has the nurses, and the questions, and the door that opens for people I don't know."
    le "你有时候也会去我的房间。可是那里还有护士，有问题，还有一扇经常被我不认识的人打开的门。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3798
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_bb982ac4:

    # le "Down here, it's just us. I like that better."
    le "在这里，只有我们两个。我更喜欢这样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:3819
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_24f33512:

    # le "Hey, what's that?"
    le "哎，那是什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:4689
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_69f6b145_9:

    # le "Okay."
    le "好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:4774
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ecc689d5:

    # le "Why won't you, huh...?! WHY WON'T YOU~?!"
    le "你为什么不愿意，啊……？！{b}为什么你就是不行动？！！！"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5303
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_23740f66:

    # un "Temporary placement. Seems like that didn't pan out your way."
    un "临时寄养啊。看来你那边不太顺利。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5373
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_54748201:

    # fr "She gets overwhelmed by kindness. Most of them do, at first."
    fr "因为那里的善意太浓厚了。大多数孩子刚开始都会这样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5399
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c3297c2e:

    # wait "Sure thing."
    wait "没问题。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5402
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4a2d1dbf:

    # wait "Refill for you, hon?"
    wait "你要续杯吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5413
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_52372e69:

    # mc "You went above and beyond to find me just to tell me \"something\"?"
    mc "你大老远跑来找我，就是为了告诉我“一件事”？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5415
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_39a1e144:

    # mc "A ten-year-old girl, basement, candy jar. Yeah, real homey setup you had going."
    mc "一个十岁的小女孩被关在地下室里，旁边再放个糖果罐。这场景够温馨的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5424
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b5847bd7:

    # yt "Not the same guy who stood over me and made speeches like he was reading from a script."
    yt "不再是那个居高临下，像读台词一样喋喋不休的人了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5425
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fd5a65e4:

    # yt "That Francis wanted a reaction. This one doesn't. What the hell happened to him?"
    yt "那个弗朗西斯想看到回应。但这个并不想。他到底是怎么了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5433
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b7cb868b:

    # mc "Those children are not a missing piece, Francis. Leah's just a kid."
    mc "那些小孩不是什么缺失的部分，弗朗西斯。莉娅只是个孩子。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5434
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_81acee0e:

    # fr "I know what she is. I also know what she carries, whether she knows it or not."
    fr "我知道她是什么人。我也知道她背负着什么。虽然她自己可能并不清楚。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5444
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f6dbde3b:

    # fr "Old debts, names, even memories. He said most of them never even figure it out."
    fr "过去欠的债，名字，甚至是记忆。他说大多数人甚至从来没有弄清楚过。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5445
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_aa966543:

    # fr "You strike me as one of those people."
    fr "在我看来，你就是那种人。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5473
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2f6427ea:

    # mc "Didn't know you could hide your serum signature like that. You really are dangerous, like Moon said."
    mc "没想到你还能这么完美地把血清的特征给隐藏起来。月说得对，你很危险。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5474
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3864a381:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5477
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_925ce11f:

    # mc "You work here?"
    mc "你在这里上班？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5478
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_8a64aa2f:

    # ao "Part-time..."
    ao "兼职……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5479
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d40673bb:

    # mc "Right. Part-time."
    mc "行吧，兼职。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5482
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_128b7462:

    # ao "Relax... Jess asked me to keep an eye out on this side of the city... You just happen to be in it..."
    ao "别紧张……是婕斯让我多盯着这片区域……你只是恰巧来了这里……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5486
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_29fa3d40:

    # mc "Hm, convenient."
    mc "嗯，真巧啊。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5487
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_dbd8dd86:

    # ao "Very..."
    ao "是的……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5488
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d9f461e3:

    # ao "I'm telling you... I actually do work here... You can keep your guard down..."
    ao "我说实话……我的确在这里上班……你不用那么戒备……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5491
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_47369fcf:

    # mc "How much of that did you hear?"
    mc "你听到了多少？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5492
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_fca35fc1:

    # ao "Just enough to know he walked out on his own legs... That was generous..."
    ao "足够让我知道你把他给放跑了……你真大度……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5493
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7c4e3f0b:

    # mc "He had men outside. Can't really risk the customers here."
    mc "他的手下就在外面。我不想把这里的顾客卷进来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5496
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3864a381_1:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5497
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b1432ac3:

    # ao "So you filed through DFCS... got rejected... and now you're sitting here with a cold coffee and a crease in your forehead..."
    ao "所以你通过DFCS提交申请……被拒绝了……现在你坐在这里，喝着冷咖啡，眉头紧锁……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5498
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_926010ac:

    # mc "That... about covers it, yeah."
    mc "事情……差不多的确是这样。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5499
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c01dae9d:

    # ao "I take it you're here because you want to file an appeal...?"
    ao "我猜你是想再申诉一下……？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5500
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e9170068:

    # mc "After that one? \"Wanted\"."
    mc "现在已经没有那个念头了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5503
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6ecaf7ba:

    # ao "You know... we don't go through those channels..."
    ao "我们一般不会用这种渠道……你懂的吧……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5504
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_329bb0b3:

    # mc "I don't really want to tell a kid that I got her through questionable means."
    mc "我可不想让小孩知道我是用歪门邪道才收养她的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5505
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_734e4c05:

    # mc "In that case, I'd be no different from Francis."
    mc "那样的话，我就和弗朗西斯没什么区别了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5506
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_def7a4e6:

    # ao "You know what they say back in the military...? Clean is a nice word for slow..."
    ao "告诉你一句我在军队里常听到的话吧……正规就只是好听一点的缓慢……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5509
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ebf75fac:

    # mc "... Like the way you talk?"
    mc "……就和你说话一样慢？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5510
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3864a381_2:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5513
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_e3e4fb96:

    # ao "Not my intention to tell you what to do... Sorry..."
    ao "我不是想对你指手画脚的……抱歉……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5514
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_214fa582:

    # mc "Nah... You're good. Just yanking your chain."
    mc "不用……没关系的。只是逗逗你。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5515
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_7b4e3700:

    # mc "Besides, I already know who I'm calling."
    mc "再说，我已经知道该联系谁了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5518
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_514484d2:

    # ao "Then drink your coffee... I brewed it for you... It's been cold for ten minutes..."
    ao "那就把咖啡喝了吧……我亲手给你泡的……十分钟之前就已经凉了……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5519
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_18b82544:

    # mc "I take you're here just to tell me to drink my coffee? You hate it when people reject your food, huh?"
    mc "你过来只是为了让我喝你的咖啡？你不喜欢别人浪费你做的东西？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5522
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ebf408d2:

    # ao "Try me..."
    ao "不要得寸进尺……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5523
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ed07ce86:

    # mc "*scoffs* I'll take that as a yes."
    mc "*笑* 看来是被我说中了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5527
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_49d53c05:

    # ao "Anyway... good luck..."
    ao "总之……祝你好运……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5530
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d9a5ae36:

    # mc "What you said about the whiskey. Does that still stand?"
    mc "你之前跟我说过威士忌的事。还算数吗？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5533
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b0c90ec7:

    # ao "Once you figure it out... anytime..."
    ao "等你弄清楚之后……随时可以来找我……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5562
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b4daca8c_1:

    # j "[mc]."
    j "[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5563
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_37bdc632_1:

    # mc "I need Eliza again."
    mc "我又需要伊莉莎帮忙了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5564
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_ab200dc8_1:

    # j "What's going on?"
    j "出什么事了？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5565
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_80c6c28d_1:

    # mc "Our unfinished business."
    mc "是我们的未竟之事。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5566
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_55fe65cd_1:

    # j "Ours... or yours?"
    j "我们的……还是你的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5568
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b4fa3fc0_1:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5569
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_2779f5ab_1:

    # j "I'll get her down. Come when you're ready."
    j "我会通知她。你准备好就过来。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5597
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_165df710:

    # mc "The President going to have a problem with this?"
    mc "总统会不会有意见？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5598
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6a3d148a:

    # el "He'll ask questions. But Francis has been on our radar long before yours. This was always ours to close."
    el "他肯定会问东问西的。但我们盯上弗朗西斯的时间比你还早。这事本来就该我们解决。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5607
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_28cb42b3:

    # tim "Don't see a reason in not being at this point."
    tim "都到了这份上，我没有不配合的理由。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5613
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6f52ede8:

    # tim "I just wanna know. I was the one feeding her. Making sure she had what she needed."
    tim "我只是想知道。我就是负责给她吃饭的人。尽量满足她的要求。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5618
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f65b68f8:

    # tim "Don't know. She just always did. Maybe she just doesn't like the food."
    tim "不知道。她就是总会剩下一半。可能她不喜欢吃吧。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5661
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b3777eb0:

    # mc "Hospital database. HC General."
    mc "我想看HC综合医院的数据库。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5676
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_c1767362:

    # el "HC General runs Medicore V4 on their backend. Government-adjacent, not government-grade."
    el "HC医院后端用的是中等水平的V4模型。跟政府联合研发的，但没有政府用的真家伙那么厉害。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5698
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_836b2558:

    # el "Doesn't matter if he does. His possible contact inside won't. People get sloppy when they think they're invisible."
    el "他知不知道都无所谓。他安插在医院里的人肯定不知道。人一旦觉得自己躲在暗处，就会放松警惕。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5711
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3468d0ac:

    # tim "That's right."
    tim "没错。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5714
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4855a159:

    # e "How did you get recruited?"
    e "你怎么认识他的？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5718
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_953efdff:

    # e "And you still took the job."
    e "但你还是干了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5721
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_6821f804:

    # tim "Do you have kids, Detective?"
    tim "你有孩子吗，警官？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5722
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_3ea87455:

    # e "... No."
    e "……没有。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5723
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5a2300da:

    # tim "Well, I've got two and a landlord who doesn't give a shit about either of them."
    tim "我有两个孩子，还有个除了钱什么都不在乎的房东。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5734
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_86ffb175:

    # tim "He's... not right."
    tim "他……不正常。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5755
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_a0b7e473:

    # e "And the children? What's he really after?"
    e "那为什么要绑架小孩？他真正的目的是什么？"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5793
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_4b37301c:

    # el "One this morning. About two hours ago."
    el "还有一次在今天上午。大概两个小时之前。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5800
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_773412ff:

    # el "Someone used a local terminal on the pediatric floor to export the file. Not to an external drive, but to an encrypted relay address."
    el "有人用儿科的终端导出了文件。没有导出到外部硬盘上，而是导出到了一个加密的中继地址。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5818
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_d76a7e33:

    # el "Give me a minute."
    el "马上就好。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5824
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_23416d61:

    # tim "I think..."
    tim "我觉得……"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5827
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_5a4b7700:

    # tim "I think she might just be something he built in his head to survive whatever happened to him."
    tim "我觉得那个妹妹可能只是他为了弥补创伤，幻想出来的。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5832
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_f180ce5f:

    # tim "The creepy part isn't that he's looking for her. The creepy part is he genuinely believes he's close."
    tim "最诡异的不是他铁了心要找到她。而是他真心觉得自己快成功了。"

# game/ch2ep2.rpy:5844
translate chinese sktabdinwikcont_b2a6a6eb:

    # tim "But the thing is... He's never really talked to her in person. Always just talked or watched her in front of a camera."
